    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Lambda的并发管理，包括预置并发（Provisioned Concurrency）和保留并发（Reserved Concurrency） 。\nAmazon DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) 的使用和优化。\nAWS Application Auto Scaling 的配置和使用。\n如何优化Lambda函数的冷启动时间和响应时间。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function with a concurrency value of 1. Delete the DAX cluster for the DynamoDB table.\n正确性分析：配置预置并发可以减少冷启动时间，但将并发值设置为1无法满足高峰期的请求量需求。此外，删除DAX会导致DynamoDB查询性能下降，进一步增加响应时间。\n结论：错误。\nB. Configure reserved concurrency on the Lambda function with a concurrency value of 0.\n正确性分析：将保留并发设置为0会完全禁用Lambda函数的执行，导致应用无法响应任何请求。这显然不符合需求。\n结论：错误。\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with\nprovisioned concurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n正确性分析：预置并发可以显著减少冷启动时间，确保Lambda函数在高峰期和低峰期都能快速响应。通过AWS Application Auto Scaling动态调整预置并发值，可以根据请求量自动扩展或缩减资源，满足全天的需求。\n结论：正确。\nD. Configure reserved concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the API Gateway API with a reserved\nconcurrency maximum value of 100.\n正确性分析：保留并发用于限制Lambda函数的最大并发执行数，但无法解决冷启动问题。此外，API Gateway的Auto Scaling与Lambda的并发管理无直接关联，无法优化Lambda的响应时间。\n结论：错误。\n3. 我选的答案\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with provisioned\nconcurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n4. 官方答案\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with provisioned\nconcurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析：预置并发解决了冷启动问题，AWS Application Auto Scaling动态调整资源满足全天的请求量变化，是最优解决方案。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Lambda的并发管理，包括预置并发（Provisioned Concurrency）和保留并发（Reserved Concurrency） 。\nAmazon DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) 的使用和优化。\nAWS Application Auto Scaling 的配置和使用。\n如何优化Lambda函数的冷启动时间和响应时间。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function with a concurrency value of 1. Delete the DAX cluster for the DynamoDB table.\n正确性分析：配置预置并发可以减少冷启动时间，但将并发值设置为1无法满足高峰期的请求量需求。此外，删除DAX会导致DynamoDB查询性能下降，进一步增加响应时间。\n结论：错误。\nB. Configure reserved concurrency on the Lambda function with a concurrency value of 0.\n正确性分析：将保留并发设置为0会完全禁用Lambda函数的执行，导致应用无法响应任何请求。这显然不符合需求。\n结论：错误。\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with\nprovisioned concurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n正确性分析：预置并发可以显著减少冷启动时间，确保Lambda函数在高峰期和低峰期都能快速响应。通过AWS Application Auto Scaling动态调整预置并发值，可以根据请求量自动扩展或缩减资源，满足全天的需求。\n结论：正确。\nD. Configure reserved concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the API Gateway API with a reserved\nconcurrency maximum value of 100.\n正确性分析：保留并发用于限制Lambda函数的最大并发执行数，但无法解决冷启动问题。此外，API Gateway的Auto Scaling与Lambda的并发管理无直接关联，无法优化Lambda的响应时间。\n结论：错误。\n3. 我选的答案\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with provisioned\nconcurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n4. 官方答案\nC. Configure provisioned concurrency on the Lambda function. Configure AWS Application Auto Scaling on the Lambda function with provisioned\nconcurrency values set to a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 100.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析：预置并发解决了冷启动问题，AWS Application Auto Scaling动态调整资源满足全天的请求量变化，是最优解决方案。",
