        "textEn": "Create an SCP that includes a Deny statement for changes to the auditing application's IAM role. Include a condition that allows the trusted administrator IAM role to make changes. Attach the SCP to the root of the organization.",
        "textZh": "创建一个包含Deny语句的SCP，用于禁止对审计应用程序IAM角色的更改。包括一个条件，允许受信任的管理员IAM角色进行更改。将SCP附加到组织的根节点。",
