    "stem": "开发人员正在维护一个由50台Amazon EC2 Linux服务器组成的集群。这些服务器是Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling组的一部分，并使用Elastic Load Balancing进行负载均衡。偶尔，一些应用服务器在ELB HTTP健康检查失败后会被终止。开发人员希望对问题进行根本原因分析，但在能够访问应用日志之前，服务器已经被终止。如何自动化日志收集？",
    "stemEn": "A developer is maintaining a fleet of 50 Amazon EC2 Linux servers. The servers are part of an Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling group, and also use Elastic Load Balancing for load balancing. Occasionally, some application servers are being terminated after failing ELB HTTP health checks. The developer would like to perform a root cause analysis on the issue, but before being able to access application logs, the server is terminated. How can log collection be automated?",
    "stemZh": "开发人员正在维护一个由50台Amazon EC2 Linux服务器组成的集群。这些服务器是Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling组的一部分，并使用Elastic Load Balancing进行负载均衡。偶尔，一些应用服务器在ELB HTTP健康检查失败后会被终止。开发人员希望对问题进行根本原因分析，但在能够访问应用日志之前，服务器已经被终止。如何自动化日志收集？",
