        "key": "A",
        "id": "A",
        "text": "Add a stage to the CodePipeline pipeline between the source and deploy stages. Use AWS CodeBuild to create a runtime environment and build commands in the buildspec file to invoke test scripts. If errors are found, use the aws deploy stop-deployment command to stop the deployment.",
        "textEn": "Add a stage to the CodePipeline pipeline between the source and deploy stages. Use AWS CodeBuild to create a runtime environment and build commands in the buildspec file to invoke test scripts. If errors are found, use the aws deploy stop-deployment command to stop the deployment.",
        "textZh": "在CodePipeline 的流水线中，在源阶段和部署阶段之间添加一个阶段。使用AWS CodeBuild 创建一个运行时环境，并在buildspec文件中构建命令以调用测试脚本。如果发现错误，使用aws deploy stop-deployment 命令停止部署。"
