        "textEn": "Enable Amazon Inspector. Include the Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures-1.1 rules package to check the security groups that are associated with the bastion hosts. Configure Amazon Inspector to publish a message to an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic.",
        "textZh": "启用 Amazon Inspector。包括 Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures-1.1 规则包，以检查与堡垒主机关联的安全组。配置 Amazon Inspector 将消息发布到 Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) 主题。"
