    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Inspector的工作原理及依赖项。\nAWS Systems Manager Agent的安装与配置。\n安全组配置与网络通信要求。\n实例配置文件与权限管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Verify that AWS Systems Manager Agent is installed and is running on the EC2 instances that Amazon Inspector is not scanning.\n正确。Amazon Inspector依赖AWS Systems Manager Agent来扫描EC2实例。如果Agent未安装或未运行，实例将无法被扫描。\nB. Associate the target EC2 instances with security groups that allow outbound communication on port 443 to the AWS Systems Manager\nservice endpoint.\n正确。AWS Systems Manager需要通过端口443与服务端点通信。如果安全组未正确配置，实例将无法与AWS Systems Manager通信。\nC. Grant inspector:StartAssessmentRun permissions to the IAM role that the DevOps engineer is using.\n错误。此权限与启动Amazon Inspector评估相关，但与实例是否被扫描无关。\nD. Configure EC2 Instance Connect for the EC2 instances that Amazon Inspector is not scanning.\n错误。EC2 Instance Connect用于SSH连接，与Amazon Inspector扫描无关。\nE. Associate the target EC2 instances with instance profiles that grant permissions to communicate with AWS Systems Manager.\n正确。EC2实例需要关联具有适当权限的实例配置文件，以便与AWS Systems Manager通信。\nF. Create a managed-instance activation. Use the Activation Code and the Activation ID to register the EC2 instances.\n错误。托管实例激活通常用于非EC2实例（如本地服务器） ，而不是用于Amazon EC2实例。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nB\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nB\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
