        "textEn": "Create a log group in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Create an Amazon S3 bucket to hold query results. Configure the VPC flow log to capture all traffic and to send the data to the log group. Deploy an Amazon Athena CloudWatch connector in AWS Lambda. Connect the connector to the log group. Configure Athena to periodically query for all accepted traffic from the IP addresses on the deny list and to store the results in the S3 bucket. Configure an S3 event notification to automatically notify the security team through an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic when new objects are added to the S3 bucket.",
        "textZh": "在Amazon CloudWatch Logs中创建一个日志组。创建一个用于存储查询结果的Amazon S3桶。配置VPC流日志以捕获所有流量，并将数据发送到日志组。在AWS Lambda中部署一个Amazon Athena CloudWatch连接器。将连接器连接到日志组。配置Athena定期查询拒绝列表中IP地址的所有已接受流量，并将结果存储到S3桶中。配置S3事件通知，当新对象被添加到S3桶时，通过Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题自动通知安全团队。"
