    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon API Gateway的SDK导出功能。\nAWS CodePipeline的集成与自动化能力。\nAmazon CloudFront缓存失效机制。\nAWS Lambda的使用与事件驱动架构。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create a CodePipeline action immediately after the deployment stage of the API. Configure the action to invoke an AWS Lambda function.\nConfigure the Lambda function to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and create a CloudFront invalidation for the SDK path.\n正确：此选项直接在CodePipeline中添加一个操作，使用Lambda函数完成SDK的下载、上传到S3以及CloudFront缓存失效。这种方式完全自动化，符合题目要求。\nB. Create a CodePipeline action immediately after the deployment stage of the API. Configure the action to use the CodePipeline integration\nwith API Gateway to export the SDK to Amazon S3. Create another action that uses the CodePipeline integration with Amazon S3 to invalidate the cache for the SDK path.\n错误：CodePipeline没有直接与API Gateway集成以导出SDK的功能。此选项描述的操作无法实现。\nC. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to UpdateStage events from aws.apigateway. Configure the rule to invoke an AWS Lambda\nfunction to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and call the CloudFront API to create an invalidation for the SDK path.\n错误：UpdateStage事件并不直接与API Gateway的SDK导出相关联。此选项的触发条件不符合题目要求。\nD. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to CreateDeployment events from aws.apigateway. Configure the rule to invoke an AWS\nLambda function to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and call the S3 API to invalidate the cache for the SDK path.\n错误：虽然CreateDeployment事件可以与API Gateway的部署相关联，但调用S3 API进行缓存失效并不是正确的方式。CloudFront的缓存失效需要通过CloudFront API完成。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon API Gateway的SDK导出功能。\nAWS CodePipeline的集成与自动化能力。\nAmazon CloudFront缓存失效机制。\nAWS Lambda的使用与事件驱动架构。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create a CodePipeline action immediately after the deployment stage of the API. Configure the action to invoke an AWS Lambda function.\nConfigure the Lambda function to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and create a CloudFront invalidation for the SDK path.\n正确：此选项直接在CodePipeline中添加一个操作，使用Lambda函数完成SDK的下载、上传到S3以及CloudFront缓存失效。这种方式完全自动化，符合题目要求。\nB. Create a CodePipeline action immediately after the deployment stage of the API. Configure the action to use the CodePipeline integration\nwith API Gateway to export the SDK to Amazon S3. Create another action that uses the CodePipeline integration with Amazon S3 to invalidate the cache for the SDK path.\n错误：CodePipeline没有直接与API Gateway集成以导出SDK的功能。此选项描述的操作无法实现。\nC. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to UpdateStage events from aws.apigateway. Configure the rule to invoke an AWS Lambda\nfunction to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and call the CloudFront API to create an invalidation for the SDK path.\n错误：UpdateStage事件并不直接与API Gateway的SDK导出相关联。此选项的触发条件不符合题目要求。\nD. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to CreateDeployment events from aws.apigateway. Configure the rule to invoke an AWS\nLambda function to download the SDK from API Gateway, upload the SDK to the S3 bucket, and call the S3 API to invalidate the cache for the SDK path.\n错误：虽然CreateDeployment事件可以与API Gateway的部署相关联，但调用S3 API进行缓存失效并不是正确的方式。CloudFront的缓存失效需要通过CloudFront API完成。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
