        "text": "Configure AWS Config to send all evaluation results for the restricted-ssh rule to the SNS topic. Configure a filter policy on the SNS topic to send only notifications that contain the text of NON_COMPLIANT in the notification to subscribers.",
        "textEn": "Configure AWS Config to send all evaluation results for the restricted-ssh rule to the SNS topic. Configure a filter policy on the SNS topic to send only notifications that contain the text of NON_COMPLIANT in the notification to subscribers.",
        "textZh": "配置AWS Config将受限SSH规则的所有评估结果发送到SNS主题。在SNS主题上配置过滤策略，仅向订阅者发送包含NON_COMPLIANT文本的通知。"
