        "text": "Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to invoke AWS Systems Manager Run Command on the SNS topic to customize a notification and to publish the notification to the SNS topic.",
        "textEn": "Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to invoke AWS Systems Manager Run Command on the SNS topic to customize a notification and to publish the notification to the SNS topic.",
        "textZh": "创建一个Amazon EventBridge规则，该规则匹配受限SSH规则的AWS Config评估结果为NON_COMPLIANT。将EventBridge规则配置为调用AWS Systems Manager Run Command到SNS主题以定制通知，并将通知发布到SNS主题。"
