        "textEn": "Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches all AWS Config evaluation results of NON_COMPLIANT. Configure an input transformer for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to publish a notification to the SNS topic.",
        "textZh": "创建一个Amazon EventBridge规则，该规则匹配所有AWS Config评估结果为NON_COMPLIANT。为受限SSH规则配置输入转换器。将EventBridge规则配置为向SNS主题发布通知。"
