    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Config规则的评估结果处理Amazon EventBridge规则的使用Amazon SNS的通知机制输入转换器的配置\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure\nan input transformer for the EventBridge rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to publish a notification to the SNS topic.\n正确：此选项直接匹配AWS Config评估结果为NON_COMPLIANT的情况，并使用EventBridge规则将通知发布到SNS主题。输入转换器可以定制通知内容，满足题目要求。\nB. Configure AWS Config to send all evaluation results for the restricted-ssh rule to the SNS topic. Configure a filter policy on the SNS topic to\nsend only notifications that contain the text of NON_COMPLIANT in the notification to subscribers.\n错误：AWS Config无法直接发送定制化通知到SNS主题。虽然可以通过过滤策略筛选通知，但无法满足题目中要求的“定制化通知”需求。\nC. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure\nthe EventBridge rule to invoke AWS Systems Manager Run Command on the SNS topic to customize a notification and to publish the notification to the SNS topic.\n错误：AWS Systems Manager Run Command不适用于直接定制SNS通知。此选项增加了不必要的复杂性，且不符合题目要求。\nD. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches all AWS Config evaluation results of NON_COMPLIANT. Configure an input transformer for\nthe restricted-ssh rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to publish a notification to the SNS topic.\n错误：此选项匹配所有NON_COMPLIANT评估结果，而不是仅针对restricted-ssh规则，范围过于宽泛，不符合题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Config规则的评估结果处理Amazon EventBridge规则的使用Amazon SNS的通知机制输入转换器的配置\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure\nan input transformer for the EventBridge rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to publish a notification to the SNS topic.\n正确：此选项直接匹配AWS Config评估结果为NON_COMPLIANT的情况，并使用EventBridge规则将通知发布到SNS主题。输入转换器可以定制通知内容，满足题目要求。\nB. Configure AWS Config to send all evaluation results for the restricted-ssh rule to the SNS topic. Configure a filter policy on the SNS topic to\nsend only notifications that contain the text of NON_COMPLIANT in the notification to subscribers.\n错误：AWS Config无法直接发送定制化通知到SNS主题。虽然可以通过过滤策略筛选通知，但无法满足题目中要求的“定制化通知”需求。\nC. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches an AWS Config evaluation result of NON_COMPLIANT for the restricted-ssh rule. Configure\nthe EventBridge rule to invoke AWS Systems Manager Run Command on the SNS topic to customize a notification and to publish the notification to the SNS topic.\n错误：AWS Systems Manager Run Command不适用于直接定制SNS通知。此选项增加了不必要的复杂性，且不符合题目要求。\nD. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that matches all AWS Config evaluation results of NON_COMPLIANT. Configure an input transformer for\nthe restricted-ssh rule. Configure the EventBridge rule to publish a notification to the SNS topic.\n错误：此选项匹配所有NON_COMPLIANT评估结果，而不是仅针对restricted-ssh规则，范围过于宽泛，不符合题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
