    "stem": "一家公司要求其数据和应用程序始终具有2 小时的RPO 和10 分钟的RTO。该应用程序使用MySQL 数据库和Amazon EC2 网页服务器。开发团队需要制定故障切换和灾难恢复的策略。哪些部署策略组合可以满足这些要求？（选择两个）",
    "stemEn": "A company requires an RPO of 2 hours and an RTO of 10 minutes for its data and application at all times. An application uses a MySQL database and Amazon EC2 web servers. The development team needs a strategy for failover and disaster recovery. Which combination of deployment strategies will meet these requirements? (Choose two.)",
