        "textEn": "Set up the application in two Regions and use a multi-Region Auto Scaling group behind Application Load Balancers to manage the capacity based on demand. In the event of a disaster, adjust the Auto Scaling group’s desired instance count to increase baseline capacity in the failover Region.",
        "textZh": "在两个区域中设置应用程序，并使用一个多区域Auto Scaling 组与Application Load Balancers 配合管理容量需求。在发生灾难时，调整Auto Scaling 组的目标实例数量以增加故障切换区域的基础容量。"
