    "communityVotes": null,
    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n灾难恢复(Disaster Recovery) 策略，包括RPO (恢复点目标) 和RTO (恢复时间目标)。\nAmazon Aurora 的全球数据库和多主集群功能。\n跨区域部署的高可用性架构设计。\nAmazon Route 53 的故障切换路由策略。\nAuto Scaling 的动态容量管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon Aurora cluster in one Availability Zone across multiple Regions as the data store. Use Aurora’s automatic recovery\ncapabilities in the event of a disaster.\n错误：Amazon Aurora 集群在单个可用区中部署无法满足跨区域灾难恢复的需求。单个可用区的部署在区域故障时无法提供快速恢复能力，无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nB. Create an Amazon Aurora global database in two Regions as the data store. In the event of a failure, promote the secondary Region as the\nprimary for the application.\n正确：Amazon Aurora 全球数据库支持跨区域复制，提供低延迟的灾难恢复能力。可以快速将辅助区域提升为主区域，满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nC. Create an Amazon Aurora multi-master cluster across multiple Regions as the data store. Use a Network Load Balancer to balance the\ndatabase traffic in different Regions.\n错误：Amazon Aurora 多主集群目前仅支持单区域部署，无法跨多个区域实现多主架构。此外，使用网络负载均衡器来平衡数据库流量并不是灾难恢复的最佳实践。\nD. Set up the application in two Regions and use Amazon Route 53 failover-based routing that points to the Application Load Balancers in both\nRegions. Use health checks to determine the availability in a given Region. Use Auto Scaling groups in each Region to adjust capacity based on demand.\n正确：跨区域部署应用程序并使用Amazon Route 53 的故障切换路由策略可以快速将流量切换到健康的区域。结合Auto Scaling 组动态调整容量，能够满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nE. Set up the application in two Regions and use a multi-Region Auto Scaling group behind Application Load Balancers to manage the capacity\nbased on demand. In the event of a disaster, adjust the Auto Scaling group’s desired instance count to increase baseline capacity in the failover Region.\n错误：多区域Auto Scaling 组的设计复杂性较高，且手动调整实例数量可能无法满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\nD\n4. 官方答案\nB\nD\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n灾难恢复(Disaster Recovery) 策略，包括RPO (恢复点目标) 和RTO (恢复时间目标)。\nAmazon Aurora 的全球数据库和多主集群功能。\n跨区域部署的高可用性架构设计。\nAmazon Route 53 的故障切换路由策略。\nAuto Scaling 的动态容量管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon Aurora cluster in one Availability Zone across multiple Regions as the data store. Use Aurora’s automatic recovery\ncapabilities in the event of a disaster.\n错误：Amazon Aurora 集群在单个可用区中部署无法满足跨区域灾难恢复的需求。单个可用区的部署在区域故障时无法提供快速恢复能力，无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nB. Create an Amazon Aurora global database in two Regions as the data store. In the event of a failure, promote the secondary Region as the\nprimary for the application.\n正确：Amazon Aurora 全球数据库支持跨区域复制，提供低延迟的灾难恢复能力。可以快速将辅助区域提升为主区域，满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nC. Create an Amazon Aurora multi-master cluster across multiple Regions as the data store. Use a Network Load Balancer to balance the\ndatabase traffic in different Regions.\n错误：Amazon Aurora 多主集群目前仅支持单区域部署，无法跨多个区域实现多主架构。此外，使用网络负载均衡器来平衡数据库流量并不是灾难恢复的最佳实践。\nD. Set up the application in two Regions and use Amazon Route 53 failover-based routing that points to the Application Load Balancers in both\nRegions. Use health checks to determine the availability in a given Region. Use Auto Scaling groups in each Region to adjust capacity based on demand.\n正确：跨区域部署应用程序并使用Amazon Route 53 的故障切换路由策略可以快速将流量切换到健康的区域。结合Auto Scaling 组动态调整容量，能够满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nE. Set up the application in two Regions and use a multi-Region Auto Scaling group behind Application Load Balancers to manage the capacity\nbased on demand. In the event of a disaster, adjust the Auto Scaling group’s desired instance count to increase baseline capacity in the failover Region.\n错误：多区域Auto Scaling 组的设计复杂性较高，且手动调整实例数量可能无法满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\nD\n4. 官方答案\nB\nD\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
