    "communityVotes": null,
    "explanation": "(\n)\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Organizations的管理与服务集成，包括Trusted Access。\nAWS Security Hub的自动化配置与合规性标准（CIS Benchmarks）。\n权限管理与用户访问控制（IAM Identity Center权限集）。\n自动化账户管理与事件驱动架构（EventBridge和Lambda）。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Turn on trusted access for Security Hub in the organization’s management account. Create a new security account by using AWS Control Tower. Configure the new security account as the delegated administrator account for Security Hub. In the new security account, provide Security Hub with the CIS Benchmarks for AWS Foundations standards.\n正确：此选项涉及启用Security Hub的可信访问，并通过AWS Control Tower创建一个专门的安全账户作为Security Hub的委派管理员。这是最佳实践，符合集中管理和合规性要求。\nB. Turn on trusted access for Security Hub in the organization’s management account. From the management account, provide Security Hub with the CIS Benchmarks for AWS Foundations standards.\n错误：虽然启用了可信访问，但直接在管理账户中配置CIS标准不符合集中管理的最佳实践。应该使用专门的安全账户来管理这些设置。\nC. Create an AWS IAM Identity Center (AWS Single Sign-On) permission set that includes the required permissions. Use the\nCreateAccountAssignment API operation to associate the security team users with the permission set and with the delegated security account.正确：此选项通过IAM Identity Center权限集为安全团队用户提供访问权限，并确保他们能够访问委派的安全账户。这符合权限管理的要求。\nD. Create an SCP that explicitly denies any user who is not on the security team from accessing Security Hub.\n错误：虽然SCP可以限制访问，但这种方法过于严格且不灵活。IAM Identity Center权限集已经能够满足需求，无需额外创建SCP。\nE. In Security Hub, turn on automatic enablement.\n正确：开启自动启用功能可以确保新创建的账户自动加入Security Hub。这是实现自动化的关键步骤。\nF. In the organization’s management account, create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to the CreateManagedAccount event. Create an AWS Lambda function that uses the Security Hub CreateMembers API operation to add new accounts to Security Hub. Configure the\nEventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function.\n错误：虽然此选项可以实现自动化，但Security Hub已经提供了自动启用功能（选项E），无需额外创建EventBridge规则和Lambda函数。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nC\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nC\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "(\n)\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Organizations的管理与服务集成，包括Trusted Access。\nAWS Security Hub的自动化配置与合规性标准（CIS Benchmarks）。\n权限管理与用户访问控制（IAM Identity Center权限集）。\n自动化账户管理与事件驱动架构（EventBridge和Lambda）。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Turn on trusted access for Security Hub in the organization’s management account. Create a new security account by using AWS Control Tower. Configure the new security account as the delegated administrator account for Security Hub. In the new security account, provide Security Hub with the CIS Benchmarks for AWS Foundations standards.\n正确：此选项涉及启用Security Hub的可信访问，并通过AWS Control Tower创建一个专门的安全账户作为Security Hub的委派管理员。这是最佳实践，符合集中管理和合规性要求。\nB. Turn on trusted access for Security Hub in the organization’s management account. From the management account, provide Security Hub with the CIS Benchmarks for AWS Foundations standards.\n错误：虽然启用了可信访问，但直接在管理账户中配置CIS标准不符合集中管理的最佳实践。应该使用专门的安全账户来管理这些设置。\nC. Create an AWS IAM Identity Center (AWS Single Sign-On) permission set that includes the required permissions. Use the\nCreateAccountAssignment API operation to associate the security team users with the permission set and with the delegated security account.正确：此选项通过IAM Identity Center权限集为安全团队用户提供访问权限，并确保他们能够访问委派的安全账户。这符合权限管理的要求。\nD. Create an SCP that explicitly denies any user who is not on the security team from accessing Security Hub.\n错误：虽然SCP可以限制访问，但这种方法过于严格且不灵活。IAM Identity Center权限集已经能够满足需求，无需额外创建SCP。\nE. In Security Hub, turn on automatic enablement.\n正确：开启自动启用功能可以确保新创建的账户自动加入Security Hub。这是实现自动化的关键步骤。\nF. In the organization’s management account, create an Amazon EventBridge rule that reacts to the CreateManagedAccount event. Create an AWS Lambda function that uses the Security Hub CreateMembers API operation to add new accounts to Security Hub. Configure the\nEventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function.\n错误：虽然此选项可以实现自动化，但Security Hub已经提供了自动启用功能（选项E），无需额外创建EventBridge规则和Lambda函数。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nC\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nC\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
