    "stemEn": "The security team depends on AWS CloudTrail to detect sensitive security issues in the company’s AWS account. The DevOps engineer needs a solution to auto-remediate CloudTrail being turned off in an AWS account. What solution ensures the LEAST amount of downtime for the CloudTrail log deliveries?",
    "stemZh": "安全团队依赖AWS CloudTrail 来检测公司AWS 账户中的敏感安全问题。DevOps 工程师需要一个解决方案来自动修复AWS 账户中CloudTrail 被关闭的情况。什么解决方案可以确保CloudTrail 日志传递的停机时间最少？",
