        "textEn": "Create an Amazon EventBridge rule for the CloudTrail StopLogging event. Create an AWS Lambda function that uses the AWS SDK to call StartLogging on the ARN of the resource in which StopLogging was called. Add the Lambda function ARN as a target to the EventBridge rule.",
        "textZh": "为CloudTrail 的StopLogging 事件创建一个Amazon EventBridge 规则。创建一个AWS Lambda 函数，该函数使用AWS SDK 调用StartLogging，目标是StopLogging 被调用的资源的ARN。将Lambda 函数的ARN 添加为EventBridge 规则的目标。",
