        "text": "Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm for the UnhealthyHostCount metric. Include an appropriate alarm threshold for the target group. Create an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic as the target to signal success or failure to CloudFormation.",
        "textEn": "Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm for the UnhealthyHostCount metric. Include an appropriate alarm threshold for the target group. Create an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic as the target to signal success or failure to CloudFormation.",
        "textZh": "为UnhealthyHostCount指标创建一个Amazon CloudWatch警报。为目标组设置一个适当的警报阈值。创建一个Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题作为目标，用于向CloudFormation发送成功或失败信号。"
