    "stem": "一家公司最近将其传统应用程序从本地迁移到AWS。该应用程序托管在Amazon EC2实例上，位于Application Load Balancer后面，而Application Load Balancer又位于Amazon API Gateway后面。该公司希望确保用户在部署应用程序新版本期间尽可能少地受到干扰。公司还希望确保在出现问题时能够快速回滚更新。哪种解决方案可以以最小的应用程序更改满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company recently migrated its legacy application from on-premises to AWS. The application is hosted on Amazon EC2 instances behind an Application Load Balancer, which is behind Amazon API Gateway. The company wants to ensure users experience minimal disruptions during any deployment of a new version of the application. The company also wants to ensure it can quickly roll back updates if there is an issue. Which solution will meet these requirements with MINIMAL changes to the application?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司最近将其传统应用程序从本地迁移到AWS。该应用程序托管在Amazon EC2实例上，位于Application Load Balancer后面，而Application Load Balancer又位于Amazon API Gateway后面。该公司希望确保用户在部署应用程序新版本期间尽可能少地受到干扰。公司还希望确保在出现问题时能够快速回滚更新。哪种解决方案可以以最小的应用程序更改满足这些要求？",
