    "stemEn": "A company is storing 100 GB of log data in.csv format in an Amazon S3 bucket. SQL developers want to query this data and generate graphs to visualize it. The SQL developers also need an efficient, automated way to store metadata from the.csv file. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements with the LEAST amount of effort? (Choose three.)",
