        "textEn": "Use Systems Manager Patch Manager to schedule patching for the EC2 instances, AWS IoT Greengrass devices, and on-premises servers as a Systems Manager maintenance window task.",
        "textZh": "使用Systems Manager Patch Manager将EC2实例、AWS IoT Greengrass设备和本地服务器的补丁安排为Systems Manager维护窗口任务。",
