        "textEn": "Turn on the configuration recorder in AWS Config in all the AWS accounts to identify noncompliant resources. Enable AWS Security Hub with the --no-enable-default-standards option in all the AWS accounts. Set up AWS Config managed rules and custom rules. Set up automatic remediation by using AWS Config conformance packs. For tracking, set up a dashboard on Security Hub in a designated Security Hub administrator account.",
        "textZh": "在所有AWS 账户中启用AWS Config 的配置记录器以识别不合规资源。在所有AWS 账户中启用AWS Security Hub，并使用--no- enable-default-standards 选项。设置AWS Config 托管规则和自定义规则。通过使用AWS Config 合规包设置自动修复。为了跟踪，在指定的Security Hub 管理员账户中设置一个仪表板。",
