    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "一家公司的一名DevOps工程师正在创建一个AWS Lambda函数，用于处理来自Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题的通知。该Lambda函数将处理通知消息，并将通知消息的内容写入一个Amazon RDS Multi-AZ数据库实例。在测试期间，一名数据库管理员意外关闭了数据库实例。在数据库关闭期间，公司丢失了几条在此期间传递的SNS通知消息。 DevOps工程师需要防止未来丢失通知消息。哪些解决方案可以满足此需求？（选择两个）",
    "stemEn": "A company's DevOps engineer is creating an AWS Lambda function to process notifications from an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic. The Lambda function will process the notification messages and will write the contents of the notification messages to an Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB instance. During testing, a database administrator accidentally shut down the DB instance. While the database was down the company lost several of the SNS notification messages that were delivered during that time. The DevOps engineer needs to prevent the loss of notification messages in the future. Which solutions will meet this requirement? (Choose two.)",
    "stemZh": "一家公司的一名DevOps工程师正在创建一个AWS Lambda函数，用于处理来自Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题的通知。该Lambda函数将处理通知消息，并将通知消息的内容写入一个Amazon RDS Multi-AZ数据库实例。在测试期间，一名数据库管理员意外关闭了数据库实例。在数据库关闭期间，公司丢失了几条在此期间传递的SNS通知消息。 DevOps工程师需要防止未来丢失通知消息。哪些解决方案可以满足此需求？（选择两个）",
