    "stem": "AnyCompany 使用AWS Organizations 来创建和管理多个AWS 账户。AnyCompany 最近收购了一家较小的公司Example Corp。在收购过程中，Example Corp 的单一AWS 账户通过Organizations 邀请加入了AnyCompany 的管理账户。AnyCompany 将新的成员账户移到了一个专门为Example Corp 设置的OU 下。 AnyCompany 的DevOps 工程师拥有一个IAM 用户，该用户会假设一个名为OrganizationAccountAccessRole 的角色来访问成员账户。这个角色配置了一个完全访问策略。当DevOps 工程师尝试使用AWS Management Console 假设Example Corp 新成员账户中的角色时，收到以下错误信息：“Invalid information in one or more fields. Check your information or contact your administrator.”哪个解决方案可以让DevOps 工程师访问新的成员账户？",
    "stemEn": "AnyCompany is using AWS Organizations to create and manage multiple AWS accounts. AnyCompany recently acquired a smaller company, Example Corp. During the acquisition process, Example Corp's single AWS account joined AnyCompany's management account through an Organizations invitation. AnyCompany moved the new member account under an OU that is dedicated to Example Corp. AnyCompany's DevOps engineer has an IAM user that assumes a role that is named OrganizationAccountAccessRole to access member accounts. This role is configured with a full access policy. When the DevOps engineer tries to use the AWS Management Console to assume the role in Example Corp's new member account, the DevOps engineer receives the following error message: \"Invalid information in one or more fields. Check your information or contact your administrator.\" Which solution will give the DevOps engineer access to the new member account?",
    "stemZh": "AnyCompany 使用AWS Organizations 来创建和管理多个AWS 账户。AnyCompany 最近收购了一家较小的公司Example Corp。在收购过程中，Example Corp 的单一AWS 账户通过Organizations 邀请加入了AnyCompany 的管理账户。AnyCompany 将新的成员账户移到了一个专门为Example Corp 设置的OU 下。 AnyCompany 的DevOps 工程师拥有一个IAM 用户，该用户会假设一个名为OrganizationAccountAccessRole 的角色来访问成员账户。这个角色配置了一个完全访问策略。当DevOps 工程师尝试使用AWS Management Console 假设Example Corp 新成员账户中的角色时，收到以下错误信息：“Invalid information in one or more fields. Check your information or contact your administrator.”哪个解决方案可以让DevOps 工程师访问新的成员账户？",
