    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAuto Scaling组的健康检查机制。\nAmazon CloudWatch监控和告警的配置。\n如何处理应用程序内存泄漏问题以提高系统的弹性。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Change the Auto Scaling configuration to replace the instances when they fail the load balancer's health checks.\n正确：此选项通过配置Auto Scaling组的健康检查机制，确保当实例未通过负载均衡器的健康检查时，自动替换故障实例。这是解决问题的关键步骤之一。\nB. Change the target group health check HealthCheckIntervalSeconds parameter to reduce the interval between health checks.\n错误：虽然减少健康检查间隔可能会更快发现问题，但这并不能解决应用程序内存泄漏问题，也无法提高系统的弹性。\nC. Change the target group health checks from HTTP to TCP to check if the port where the application is listening is reachable.\n错误：将健康检查从HTTP更改为TCP只会检查端口是否可达，但无法检测应用程序是否正常运行。这与题目要求无关。\nD. Enable the available memory consumption metric within the Amazon CloudWatch dashboard for the entire Auto Scaling group. Create an\nalarm when the memory utilization is high. Associate an Amazon SNS topic to the alarm to receive notifications when the alarm goes off.\n错误：虽然启用内存消耗指标和告警是监控的一部分，但CloudWatch默认不支持内存监控，必须安装CloudWatch Agent才能收集内存利用率数据。因此此选项不完全正确。\nE. Use the Amazon CloudWatch agent to collect the memory utilization of the EC2 instances in the Auto Scaling group. Create an alarm when\nthe memory utilization is high and associate an Amazon SNS topic to receive a notification.\n正确：安装CloudWatch Agent可以收集内存利用率数据，并通过告警和SNS通知及时发现内存泄漏问题。这是解决问题的关键步骤之一。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
