    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "一家公司在Amazon EC2 实例上部署了一个Web 应用程序，这些实例位于Application Load Balancer (ALB) 后面。公司将应用程序代码存储在AWS CodeCommit 仓库中。当代码合并到主分支时，AWS Lambda 函数会调用一个AWS CodeBuild 项目。CodeBuild 项目将代码打包，将打包后的代码存储在AWS CodeArtifact 中，并调用AWS Systems Manager Run Command 将打包后的代码部署到EC2 实例上。之前的部署导致了缺陷，EC2 实例未运行最新版本的打包代码，并且实例之间存在不一致。 DevOps 工程师应该采取哪些组合操作来实施更可靠的部署解决方案？（选择两个。 ）",
    "stemEn": "A company deploys a web application on Amazon EC2 instances that are behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). The company stores the application code in an AWS CodeCommit repository. When code is merged to the main branch, an AWS Lambda function invokes an AWS CodeBuild project. The CodeBuild project packages the code, stores the packaged code in AWS CodeArtifact, and invokes AWS Systems Manager Run Command to deploy the packaged code to the EC2 instances. Previous deployments have resulted in defects, EC2 instances that are not running the latest version of the packaged code, and inconsistencies between instances. Which combination of actions should a DevOps engineer take to implement a more reliable deployment solution? (Choose two.)",
    "stemZh": "一家公司在Amazon EC2 实例上部署了一个Web 应用程序，这些实例位于Application Load Balancer (ALB) 后面。公司将应用程序代码存储在AWS CodeCommit 仓库中。当代码合并到主分支时，AWS Lambda 函数会调用一个AWS CodeBuild 项目。CodeBuild 项目将代码打包，将打包后的代码存储在AWS CodeArtifact 中，并调用AWS Systems Manager Run Command 将打包后的代码部署到EC2 实例上。之前的部署导致了缺陷，EC2 实例未运行最新版本的打包代码，并且实例之间存在不一致。 DevOps 工程师应该采取哪些组合操作来实施更可靠的部署解决方案？（选择两个。 ）",
