    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon EventBridge的事件路由机制。\n如何跨账户共享事件。\nCloudTrail事件的集成与分发。\nAWS Organizations的账户管理与自动化。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule in the automation account to send account creation events to the default event bus in the services\naccounts. Update the default event bus in the services accounts to allow events from the automation account.\n正确：此选项使用默认的EventBridge事件总线，并通过规则将事件从自动化账户发送到服务账户。默认事件总线是跨账户事件共享的推荐方式，且支持权限配置以允许来自其他账户的事件。\nB. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the services accounts. Update the custom event bus to allow events from the automation\naccount. Create an EventBridge rule in the services account that directly listens to CloudTrail events from the automation account.\n错误：虽然可以创建自定义事件总线，但直接监听CloudTrail事件并不符合题目要求，因为事件需要从自动化账户发送到服务账户，而不是直接监听。\nC. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the automation account and the services accounts. Create an EventBridge rule and policy\nthat connects the custom event buses that are in the automation account and the services accounts.\n错误：创建多个自定义事件总线增加了复杂性，且题目并未要求使用自定义事件总线。默认事件总线已经可以满足需求。\nD. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the automation account. Create an EventBridge rule and policy that connects the custom\nevent bus to the default event buses in the services accounts.\n错误：虽然可以连接自定义事件总线到默认事件总线，但题目并未要求创建自定义事件总线。使用默认事件总线即可实现目标。\n3. 我的选择\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n理由：选项A是最符合题目要求的解决方案，使用默认事件总线简化了跨账户事件共享的配置，同时满足服务团队接收CloudTrail事件的需求。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon EventBridge的事件路由机制。\n如何跨账户共享事件。\nCloudTrail事件的集成与分发。\nAWS Organizations的账户管理与自动化。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule in the automation account to send account creation events to the default event bus in the services\naccounts. Update the default event bus in the services accounts to allow events from the automation account.\n正确：此选项使用默认的EventBridge事件总线，并通过规则将事件从自动化账户发送到服务账户。默认事件总线是跨账户事件共享的推荐方式，且支持权限配置以允许来自其他账户的事件。\nB. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the services accounts. Update the custom event bus to allow events from the automation\naccount. Create an EventBridge rule in the services account that directly listens to CloudTrail events from the automation account.\n错误：虽然可以创建自定义事件总线，但直接监听CloudTrail事件并不符合题目要求，因为事件需要从自动化账户发送到服务账户，而不是直接监听。\nC. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the automation account and the services accounts. Create an EventBridge rule and policy\nthat connects the custom event buses that are in the automation account and the services accounts.\n错误：创建多个自定义事件总线增加了复杂性，且题目并未要求使用自定义事件总线。默认事件总线已经可以满足需求。\nD. Create a custom Amazon EventBridge event bus in the automation account. Create an EventBridge rule and policy that connects the custom\nevent bus to the default event buses in the services accounts.\n错误：虽然可以连接自定义事件总线到默认事件总线，但题目并未要求创建自定义事件总线。使用默认事件总线即可实现目标。\n3. 我的选择\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n理由：选项A是最符合题目要求的解决方案，使用默认事件总线简化了跨账户事件共享的配置，同时满足服务团队接收CloudTrail事件的需求。",
