    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nCloudFormation服务角色的使用AWS Service Catalog的功能与约束机制AWS Config规则的使用资源漂移检测（Drift Detection）机制\n2. 选项分析\nA. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using a CloudFormation service role only. Use CloudFormation drift detection to detect when\nresources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：CloudFormation服务角色可以限制用户权限，但CloudFormation drift detection只能手动触发，无法实现自动化监控资源漂移。\n结论：错误。\nB. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using a CloudFormation service role only. Use AWS Config rules to detect when resources have\ndrifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：CloudFormation服务角色可以限制用户权限，AWS Config规则可以自动检测资源状态变化，但没有提到如何强制使用预批准的模板。\n结论：错误。\nC. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using AWS Service Catalog only. Enforce the use of a launch constraint. Use AWS Config rules\nto detect when resources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：AWS Service Catalog可以确保用户只能使用预批准的模板，启动约束（Launch Constraint）可以限制用户权限，AWS Config规则可以自动检测资源状态变化。\n结论：正确。\nD. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using AWS Service Catalog only. Enforce the use of a template constraint. Use Amazon\nEventBridge notifications to detect when resources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：AWS Service Catalog可以确保用户只能使用预批准的模板，但模板约束（Template Constraint）用于限制模板参数，而不是权限。EventBridge通知可以监控事件，但不适合资源漂移检测。\n结论：错误。\n3. 我选的答案\nC\n4. 官方答案\nC\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析：选项C全面满足题目要求，包括使用AWS Service Catalog强制预批准模板、启动约束限制权限，以及AWS Config规则实现自动化资源漂移检测。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nCloudFormation服务角色的使用AWS Service Catalog的功能与约束机制AWS Config规则的使用资源漂移检测（Drift Detection）机制\n2. 选项分析\nA. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using a CloudFormation service role only. Use CloudFormation drift detection to detect when\nresources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：CloudFormation服务角色可以限制用户权限，但CloudFormation drift detection只能手动触发，无法实现自动化监控资源漂移。\n结论：错误。\nB. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using a CloudFormation service role only. Use AWS Config rules to detect when resources have\ndrifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：CloudFormation服务角色可以限制用户权限，AWS Config规则可以自动检测资源状态变化，但没有提到如何强制使用预批准的模板。\n结论：错误。\nC. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using AWS Service Catalog only. Enforce the use of a launch constraint. Use AWS Config rules\nto detect when resources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：AWS Service Catalog可以确保用户只能使用预批准的模板，启动约束（Launch Constraint）可以限制用户权限，AWS Config规则可以自动检测资源状态变化。\n结论：正确。\nD. Allow users to deploy CloudFormation stacks using AWS Service Catalog only. Enforce the use of a template constraint. Use Amazon\nEventBridge notifications to detect when resources have drifted from their expected state.\n正确性分析：AWS Service Catalog可以确保用户只能使用预批准的模板，但模板约束（Template Constraint）用于限制模板参数，而不是权限。EventBridge通知可以监控事件，但不适合资源漂移检测。\n结论：错误。\n3. 我选的答案\nC\n4. 官方答案\nC\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析：选项C全面满足题目要求，包括使用AWS Service Catalog强制预批准模板、启动约束限制权限，以及AWS Config规则实现自动化资源漂移检测。",
