    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Organizations的服务控制策略（SCP）的使用和管理。\nIAM Access Analyzer的功能及其在权限管理中的应用。\n如何限制账户使用特定的AWS服务。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an SCP that allows the services that IAM Access Analyzer identifies. Create an OU for the account. Move the account into the new\nOU. Attach the new SCP to the new OU. Detach the default FullAWSAccess SCP from the new OU.\n正确：此选项符合要求，创建一个允许IAM Access Analyzer识别的服务的SCP，并将其附加到新的OU，同时移除默认的FullAWSAccess SCP。这种方式确保了只有当前账户中已启用的服务可以被使用。\nB. Create an SCP that denies the services that IAM Access Analyzer identifies. Create an OU for the account. Move the account into the new\nOU. Attach the new SCP to the new OU.\n错误：此选项创建了一个拒绝IAM Access Analyzer识别的服务的SCP，这与题目要求不符。题目要求允许当前账户中已启用的服务，而不是拒绝它们。\nC. Create an SCP that allows the services that IAM Access Analyzer identifies. Attach the new SCP to the organization's root.\n错误：将SCP附加到组织的根会影响所有账户，而题目要求仅针对特定账户进行限制。这种方法过于宽泛，不符合题目要求。\nD. Create an SCP that allows the services that IAM Access Analyzer identifies. Create an OU for the account. Move the account into the new OU.\nAttach the new SCP to the management account. Detach the default FullAWSAccess SCP from the new OU.\n错误：将SCP附加到管理账户是不正确的，因为管理账户通常用于管理整个组织，而不是单个OU。此选项不符合题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
    "explanationEn": "",
