    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS WAF日志管理与分析Amazon CloudWatch Logs的使用CloudWatch Metric Filters的配置如何以最低的运维开销实现日志分析和报警\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group. Configure the appropriate AWS WAF web ACL to send log messages to the log group. Instruct\nthe operations team to create CloudWatch metric filters.\n正确：此选项直接使用AWS WAF与CloudWatch Logs的集成功能，将日志发送到CloudWatch Logs。CloudWatch Metric Filters可以轻松创建报警，且无需额外的复杂配置或第三方工具。\n最低运维开销：CloudWatch Logs和Metric Filters是原生服务，操作简单，且不需要额外的资源或复杂的设置。\nB. Create an Amazon OpenSearch Service cluster and appropriate indexes. Configure an Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream to\nstream log data to the indexes. Use OpenSearch Dashboards to create filters and widgets.\n错误：虽然OpenSearch可以提供强大的日志分析功能，但设置OpenSearch集群和Kinesis Data Firehose会增加运维开销。\n额外复杂性：需要管理OpenSearch集群、索引和Kinesis Data Firehose，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\nC. Create an Amazon S3 bucket for the log output. Configure AWS WAF to send log outputs to the S3 bucket. Instruct the operations team to\ncreate AWS Lambda functions that detect each desired log message pattern. Configure the Lambda functions to publish to an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic.\n错误：虽然可以通过Lambda函数实现日志模式检测，但需要编写和维护Lambda代码，增加了运维开销。\n额外复杂性：涉及S3、Lambda、SNS等多个服务，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\nD. Create an Amazon S3 bucket for the log output. Configure AWS WAF to send log outputs to the S3 bucket. Use Amazon Athena to create an\nexternal table definition that fits the log message pattern. Instruct the operations team to write SQL queries and to create Amazon CloudWatch metric filters for the Athena queries.\n错误：虽然Athena可以查询S3中的日志，但需要编写SQL查询和配置外部表定义，增加了运维开销。\n额外复杂性：涉及S3、Athena和CloudWatch Metric Filters，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因：选项A直接使用AWS原生服务，满足最低运维开销的要求，同时提供日志分析和报警功能。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS WAF日志管理与分析Amazon CloudWatch Logs的使用CloudWatch Metric Filters的配置如何以最低的运维开销实现日志分析和报警\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon CloudWatch Logs log group. Configure the appropriate AWS WAF web ACL to send log messages to the log group. Instruct\nthe operations team to create CloudWatch metric filters.\n正确：此选项直接使用AWS WAF与CloudWatch Logs的集成功能，将日志发送到CloudWatch Logs。CloudWatch Metric Filters可以轻松创建报警，且无需额外的复杂配置或第三方工具。\n最低运维开销：CloudWatch Logs和Metric Filters是原生服务，操作简单，且不需要额外的资源或复杂的设置。\nB. Create an Amazon OpenSearch Service cluster and appropriate indexes. Configure an Amazon Kinesis Data Firehose delivery stream to\nstream log data to the indexes. Use OpenSearch Dashboards to create filters and widgets.\n错误：虽然OpenSearch可以提供强大的日志分析功能，但设置OpenSearch集群和Kinesis Data Firehose会增加运维开销。\n额外复杂性：需要管理OpenSearch集群、索引和Kinesis Data Firehose，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\nC. Create an Amazon S3 bucket for the log output. Configure AWS WAF to send log outputs to the S3 bucket. Instruct the operations team to\ncreate AWS Lambda functions that detect each desired log message pattern. Configure the Lambda functions to publish to an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic.\n错误：虽然可以通过Lambda函数实现日志模式检测，但需要编写和维护Lambda代码，增加了运维开销。\n额外复杂性：涉及S3、Lambda、SNS等多个服务，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\nD. Create an Amazon S3 bucket for the log output. Configure AWS WAF to send log outputs to the S3 bucket. Use Amazon Athena to create an\nexternal table definition that fits the log message pattern. Instruct the operations team to write SQL queries and to create Amazon CloudWatch metric filters for the Athena queries.\n错误：虽然Athena可以查询S3中的日志，但需要编写SQL查询和配置外部表定义，增加了运维开销。\n额外复杂性：涉及S3、Athena和CloudWatch Metric Filters，远高于题目要求的最低运维开销。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因：选项A直接使用AWS原生服务，满足最低运维开销的要求，同时提供日志分析和报警功能。",
