    "stem": "一家公司正在开发一个应用程序，该应用程序将生成日志事件。日志事件每十分之一秒包含五个不同的指标，并产生大量数据。该公司需要配置应用程序将日志写入Amazon Timestream。公司将针对Timestream 表配置每日查询。哪些步骤组合能够以最快的查询性能满足这些需求？（选择三个。 ）",
    "stemEn": "A company is developing an application that will generate log events. The log events consist of five distinct metrics every one tenth of a second and produce a large amount of data. The company needs to configure the application to write the logs to Amazon Timestream. The company will configure a daily query against the Timestream table. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements with the FASTEST query performance? (Choose three.)",
