    "type": "choice",
    "stem": "一家公司有一个部署在单个AWS账户中的AWS CloudFormation堆栈。该公司已配置该堆栈将事件通知发送到一个Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题。一名DevOps工程师必须实施一个自动化解决方案，仅在堆栈更新成功完成后，向特定的CloudFormation堆栈实例应用标签。该DevOps工程师已经创建了一个AWS Lambda函数，用于为特定的堆栈实例应用和更新此标签。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company has an AWS CloudFormation stack that is deployed in a single AWS account. The company has configured the stack to send event notifications to an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic. A DevOps engineer must implement an automated solution that applies a tag to the specific CloudFormation stack instance only after a successful stack update occurs. The DevOps engineer has created an AWS Lambda function that applies and updates this tag for the specific stack instance. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司有一个部署在单个AWS账户中的AWS CloudFormation堆栈。该公司已配置该堆栈将事件通知发送到一个Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS)主题。一名DevOps工程师必须实施一个自动化解决方案，仅在堆栈更新成功完成后，向特定的CloudFormation堆栈实例应用标签。该DevOps工程师已经创建了一个AWS Lambda函数，用于为特定的堆栈实例应用和更新此标签。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
