    "stem": "一个云团队使用AWS Organizations 和AWS IAM Identity Center (AWS Single Sign-On) 来管理公司的AWS 账户。公司最近成立了一个研究团队。研究团队需要能够完全管理其账户中的资源。研究团队不得创建IAM 用户。云团队在IAM Identity Center 中为研究团队创建了一个Research Administrator 权限集。该权限集附加了AdministratorAccess AWS 托管策略。云团队必须确保研究团队中的任何人都无法创建IAM 用户。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A cloud team uses AWS Organizations and AWS IAM Identity Center (AWS Single Sign-On) to manage a company's AWS accounts. The company recently established a research team. The research team requires the ability to fully manage the resources in its account. The research team must not be able to create IAM users. The cloud team creates a Research Administrator permission set in IAM Identity Center for the research team. The permission set has the AdministratorAccess AWS managed policy attached. The cloud team must ensure that no one on the research team can create IAM users. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一个云团队使用AWS Organizations 和AWS IAM Identity Center (AWS Single Sign-On) 来管理公司的AWS 账户。公司最近成立了一个研究团队。研究团队需要能够完全管理其账户中的资源。研究团队不得创建IAM 用户。云团队在IAM Identity Center 中为研究团队创建了一个Research Administrator 权限集。该权限集附加了AdministratorAccess AWS 托管策略。云团队必须确保研究团队中的任何人都无法创建IAM 用户。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
