    "stem": "一家公司在其AWS Organizations 中的AWS 账户中运行敏感工作负载。该公司使用一个IP 地址范围来分配Amazon VPC CIDR 块以及所有非云硬件的IP 地址。该公司需要一个解决方案，防止来自公司IP 地址范围之外的主体在组织的账户中执行AWS 操作。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company operates sensitive workloads across the AWS accounts that are in the company's organization in AWS Organizations. The company uses an IP address range to delegate IP addresses for Amazon VPC CIDR blocks and all non-cloud hardware. The company needs a solution that prevents principals that are outside the company’s IP address range from performing AWS actions in the organization's accounts. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司在其AWS Organizations 中的AWS 账户中运行敏感工作负载。该公司使用一个IP 地址范围来分配Amazon VPC CIDR 块以及所有非云硬件的IP 地址。该公司需要一个解决方案，防止来自公司IP 地址范围之外的主体在组织的账户中执行AWS 操作。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
