    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon ECS任务状态监控与日志记录。\n使用Amazon EventBridge捕获事件。\n使用Amazon CloudWatch Logs和CloudWatch Logs Insights进行日志分析。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to capture task state changes. Send the event to Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Use CloudWatch Logs\nInsights to investigate stopped tasks.\n正确：Amazon EventBridge可以捕获ECS任务状态变化事件，例如任务停止事件。\n正确：将事件发送到Amazon CloudWatch Logs可以存储日志数据。\n正确：CloudWatch Logs Insights可以用来查询和分析日志数据，帮助调查停止任务的原因。\nB. Configure tasks to write log data in the embedded metric format. Store the logs in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Monitor the\nContainerInstanceCount metric for changes.\n错误：嵌入指标格式主要用于自定义指标，而不是直接捕获任务状态变化。\n错误：ContainerInstanceCount是一个集群级别的指标，无法直接反映任务停止的具体原因。\nC. Configure the EC2 instances to store logs in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Create a CloudWatch Contributor Insights rule that uses the EC2\ninstance log data. Use the Contributor Insights rule to investigate stopped tasks.\n错误：Contributor Insights主要用于分析贡献者行为，而不是任务状态变化。\n错误：EC2实例日志无法直接捕获ECS任务状态变化。\nD. Configure an EC2 Auto Scaling lifecycle hook for the EC2_INSTANCE_TERMINATING scale-in event. Write the SystemEventLog file to Amazon\nS3. Use Amazon Athena to query the log file for errors.\n错误：生命周期挂钩仅适用于EC2实例的生命周期事件，与ECS任务状态变化无关。\n错误：SystemEventLog文件无法直接捕获ECS任务停止事件。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n理由：选项A正确地使用了Amazon EventBridge捕获任务状态变化，并结合CloudWatch Logs和Logs Insights进行日志分析，完全满足题目要求。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon ECS任务状态监控与日志记录。\n使用Amazon EventBridge捕获事件。\n使用Amazon CloudWatch Logs和CloudWatch Logs Insights进行日志分析。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to capture task state changes. Send the event to Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Use CloudWatch Logs\nInsights to investigate stopped tasks.\n正确：Amazon EventBridge可以捕获ECS任务状态变化事件，例如任务停止事件。\n正确：将事件发送到Amazon CloudWatch Logs可以存储日志数据。\n正确：CloudWatch Logs Insights可以用来查询和分析日志数据，帮助调查停止任务的原因。\nB. Configure tasks to write log data in the embedded metric format. Store the logs in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Monitor the\nContainerInstanceCount metric for changes.\n错误：嵌入指标格式主要用于自定义指标，而不是直接捕获任务状态变化。\n错误：ContainerInstanceCount是一个集群级别的指标，无法直接反映任务停止的具体原因。\nC. Configure the EC2 instances to store logs in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. Create a CloudWatch Contributor Insights rule that uses the EC2\ninstance log data. Use the Contributor Insights rule to investigate stopped tasks.\n错误：Contributor Insights主要用于分析贡献者行为，而不是任务状态变化。\n错误：EC2实例日志无法直接捕获ECS任务状态变化。\nD. Configure an EC2 Auto Scaling lifecycle hook for the EC2_INSTANCE_TERMINATING scale-in event. Write the SystemEventLog file to Amazon\nS3. Use Amazon Athena to query the log file for errors.\n错误：生命周期挂钩仅适用于EC2实例的生命周期事件，与ECS任务状态变化无关。\n错误：SystemEventLog文件无法直接捕获ECS任务停止事件。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n理由：选项A正确地使用了Amazon EventBridge捕获任务状态变化，并结合CloudWatch Logs和Logs Insights进行日志分析，完全满足题目要求。",
