        "textEn": "Use an Application Load Balancer and an in-place deployment. Associate the Auto Scaling group and Application Load Balancer target group with the deployment group. Use the Automatically copy Auto Scaling group option, and use CodeDeployDefault.AllatOnce as a deployment configuration. Instruct AWS CodeDeploy to terminate the original instances in the deployment group, and use the BlockTraffic hook within appspec.yml to delete the temporary files.",
        "textZh": "使用Application Load Balancer 和原位部署。将Auto Scaling 组和Application Load Balancer 目标组与部署组关联。使用Automatically copy Auto Scaling group 选项，并使用CodeDeployDefault.AllatOnce 作为部署配置。在appspec.yml 中使用BlockTraffic hook 指示AWS CodeDeploy 删除临时文件，并终止部署组中的原始实例。"
