    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Control Tower的功能和使用，包括Account Factory和Guardrails。\n如何使用AWS Control Tower实现多账户管理和基线配置。\nAWS Organizations的功能与集成。\nCI/CD基础设施的部署与管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an AWS Control Tower Account Factory Customization (AFC) blueprint that uses the baseline configuration. Use AWS Control Tower\nAccount Factory to provision a dedicated AWS account for each environment and a CI/CD account by using the blueprint.\n正确：AWS Control Tower Account Factory允许用户通过自定义蓝图快速创建和配置账户，同时应用基线配置。这种方法直接利用了Control Tower的功能，减少了操作开销。\nB. Use AWS Control Tower Account Factory to provision a dedicated AWS account for each environment and a CI/CD account. Use AWS\nCloudFormation StackSets to apply the baseline configuration to the new accounts.\n错误：虽然可以使用CloudFormation StackSets应用基线配置，但这增加了额外的操作步骤和复杂性，而Control Tower本身已经提供了自动应用基线配置的功能。\nC. Use Organizations to provision a multi-environment AWS account and a CI/CD account. In the Organizations management account, create an\nAWS Lambda function that assumes the Organizations access role to apply the baseline configuration to the new accounts.\n错误：使用Organizations直接创建账户并通过Lambda函数应用基线配置需要额外的开发工作和维护，增加了操作开销，不符合“最少操作开销”的要求。\nD. Use Organizations to provision a dedicated AWS account for each environment, an audit account, and a CI/CD account. Use AWS\nCloudFormation StackSets to apply the baseline configuration to the new accounts.\n错误：虽然可以使用Organizations和CloudFormation StackSets实现目标，但这与Control Tower的功能重复，并增加了额外的复杂性。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因：选项A直接利用了AWS Control Tower的功能，包括Account Factory和AFC蓝图，能够以最少的操作开销满足题目要求。",
