        "textEn": "Create an AWS CodeCommit repository to store the Dockerfile and Kubernetes deployment files. Create a pipeline in AWS CodePipeline. Use an Amazon EventBridge event to invoke the pipeline when a newer version of the Dockerfile is committed. Add a step to the pipeline to initiate the AWS CodeBuild project.",
        "textZh": "创建一个AWS CodeCommit 存储库来存储Dockerfile 和Kubernetes 部署文件。在AWS CodePipeline 中创建一个管道。使用Amazon EventBridge 事件在提交Dockerfile 的新版本时触发管道。向管道添加一个步骤以启动AWS CodeBuild 项目。",
