    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nCI/CD工具链的监控与可视化。\n使用AWS服务（如Lambda、CloudWatch、EventBridge、DynamoDB、QuickSight）进行自动化和数据分析。\n如何最小化配置工作量以实现目标。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Program an AWS Lambda function that creates Amazon CloudWatch custom metrics with information about successful runs and failed runs\nfor each pipeline. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function every 5 minutes. Use the metrics to build a CloudWatch dashboard.\n正确性分析：此选项通过Lambda函数生成CloudWatch自定义指标，并使用EventBridge定时触发Lambda函数。虽然可以实现目标，但定时触发可能会导致数据延迟，无法实时反映成功和失败运行的情况。\n错误原因：定时触发（每5分钟）可能无法提供实时的可见性，且配置复杂度较高。\nB. Program an AWS Lambda function that creates Amazon CloudWatch custom metrics with information about successful runs and failed runs\nfor each pipeline. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function after every successful run and after every failed run. Use the metrics to build a CloudWatch dashboard.\n正确性分析：此选项通过Lambda函数生成CloudWatch自定义指标，并使用EventBridge在每次成功或失败运行后触发Lambda函数。这种方式可以实时捕获数据，且直接使用CloudWatch仪表板进行可视化，配置工作量较少。\n正确原因：实时触发Lambda函数，直接生成CloudWatch指标，最小化配置工作量，同时满足实时可见性需求。\nC. Program an AWS Lambda function that writes information about successful runs and failed runs to Amazon DynamoDB. Create an Amazon\nEventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function after every successful run and after every failed run. Build an Amazon QuickSight dashboard to show the information from DynamoDB.\n正确性分析：此选项通过Lambda函数将数据写入DynamoDB，并使用QuickSight进行可视化。虽然可以实现目标，但QuickSight的配置和数据建模复杂度较高。\n错误原因：相比直接使用CloudWatch仪表板，QuickSight需要额外的配置工作，且不如CloudWatch实时。\nD. Program an AWS Lambda function that writes information about successful runs and failed runs to Amazon DynamoDB. Create an Amazon\nEventBridge rule to invoke the Lambda function every 5 minutes. Build an Amazon QuickSight dashboard to show the information from DynamoDB.\n正确性分析：此选项通过Lambda函数将数据写入DynamoDB，并使用EventBridge定时触发Lambda函数。QuickSight用于可视化数据。\n与选项A类似，定时触发可能导致数据延迟。\n错误原因：定时触发（每5分钟）无法实时反映数据，且QuickSight的配置复杂度较高。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\n4. 官方答案\nB\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。选项B最小化了配置工作量，同时提供了实时的可见性，符合题目要求。",
