    "stem": "一家公司开发了一个静态网站，托管在一个Amazon S3 bucket 上。该网站通过AWS CloudFormation 部署。CloudFormation 模板定义了一个S3 bucket 和一个自定义资源，该资源将内容从源位置复制到bucket 中。该公司决定需要将网站迁移到新位置，因此需要删除并重新创建现有的CloudFormation stack。然而，CloudFormation 报告该stack 无法被干净地删除。问题最可能的原因是什么，DevOps 工程师如何解决此问题以适用于当前和未来版本的网站？",
    "stemEn": "A company has developed a static website hosted on an Amazon S3 bucket. The website is deployed using AWS CloudFormation. The CloudFormation template defines an S3 bucket and a custom resource that copies content into the bucket from a source location. The company has decided that it needs to move the website to a new location, so the existing CloudFormation stack must be deleted and re- created. However, CloudFormation reports that the stack could not be deleted cleanly. What is the MOST likely cause and how can the DevOps engineer mitigate this problem for this and future versions of the website?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司开发了一个静态网站，托管在一个Amazon S3 bucket 上。该网站通过AWS CloudFormation 部署。CloudFormation 模板定义了一个S3 bucket 和一个自定义资源，该资源将内容从源位置复制到bucket 中。该公司决定需要将网站迁移到新位置，因此需要删除并重新创建现有的CloudFormation stack。然而，CloudFormation 报告该stack 无法被干净地删除。问题最可能的原因是什么，DevOps 工程师如何解决此问题以适用于当前和未来版本的网站？",
