    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Macie的使用：用于发现和保护敏感数据（如PII） 。\nAWS Step Functions的使用：用于构建自动化工作流。\nAWS KMS的权限管理：确保数据加密和解密的安全性。\n跨账户资源访问与权限配置。\nCloudFormation模板的使用：用于创建和管理AWS资源。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Activate Amazon Macie on the S3 bucket in the production account. Create an AWS Step Functions state machine to initiate a discovery job\nand redact all PII before copying files to the S3 bucket in the development account. Give the state machine tasks decrypt permissions on the KMS key in the production account. Give the state machine tasks encrypt permissions on the KMS key in the development account.\n正确：此选项符合要求，因为它使用Amazon Macie来发现和去除PII，并通过Step Functions自动化工作流来处理数据。还正确配置了KMS权限以确保加密和解密的安全性。\nB. Set up S3 replication between the production S3 bucket and the development S3 bucket. Activate Amazon Macie on the development S3\nbucket. Create an AWS Step Functions state machine to initiate a discovery job and redact all PII as the files are copied to the development S3 bucket. Give the state machine tasks encrypt and decrypt permissions on the KMS key in the development account.\n错误：S3复制会直接将数据从生产环境复制到开发环境，而没有在生产环境中去除PII，这违反了题目要求。\nC. Set up an S3 Batch Operations job to copy files from the production S3 bucket to the development S3 bucket. In the development account,\nconfigure an AWS Lambda function to redact ail PII. Configure S3 Object Lambda to use the Lambda function for S3 GET requests. Give the Lambda function's IAM role encrypt and decrypt permissions on the KMS key in the development account.\n错误：此选项在开发环境中去除PII，而不是在生产环境中去除PII，违反了题目要求。\nD. Create a development environment from the CloudFormation template in the development account. Schedule an Amazon EventBridge rule to\nstart the AWS Step Functions state machine once a week.\n正确：此选项使用CloudFormation模板创建开发环境，并通过EventBridge定期启动Step Functions工作流，符合题目要求。\nE. Create a development environment from the CloudFormation template in the development account. Schedule a cron job on an Amazon EC2\ninstance to run once a week to start the S3 Batch Operations job.\n错误：此选项使用EC2实例和cron任务来启动S3 Batch Operations，但没有提到如何去除PII，也没有提到如何处理KMS权限，无法满足题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nD\n4. 官方答案\nA\nD\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
