    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon EventBridge的调度功能及与AWS Lambda的集成。\nAmazon S3作为数据存储的使用场景。\nAWS Glue爬网程序与Amazon Athena的集成，用于数据编目和查询。\nAmazon QuickSight用于数据可视化和仪表板创建。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Configure an Amazon EventBridge schedule to invoke an AWS Lambda function that calls the API to retrieve workload metrics. Store the\nworkload metric data in an Amazon S3 bucket.\n正确：EventBridge可以定时触发Lambda函数，Lambda函数可以调用API并将数据存储到S3。S3是一个常用的数据存储解决方案，适合后续分析和处理。\nB. Configure an Amazon EventBridge schedule to invoke an AWS Lambda function that calls the API to retrieve workload metrics. Store the\nworkload metric data in an Amazon DynamoDB table that has a DynamoDB stream enabled.\n错误：虽然DynamoDB可以存储数据并启用流，但题目要求的是分析和可视化数据。DynamoDB不适合直接用于大规模数据分析和可视化。\nC. Create an AWS Glue crawler to catalog the workload metric data in the Amazon S3 bucket. Create views in Amazon Athena for the cataloged\ndata.\n正确：AWS Glue爬网程序可以对S3中的数据进行编目，Amazon Athena可以基于编目的数据创建视图并进行查询分析。\nD. Connect an AWS Glue crawler to the Amazon DynamoDB stream to catalog the workload metric data. Create views in Amazon Athena for the\ncataloged data.\n错误：AWS Glue爬网程序无法直接连接到DynamoDB流。DynamoDB流主要用于实时数据处理，而不是数据编目。\nE. Create Amazon QuickSight datasets from the Amazon Athena views. Create a QuickSight analysis to visualize the workload metric data as a\ndashboard.\n正确：Amazon QuickSight可以基于Athena视图创建数据集，并生成仪表板以可视化数据。\nF. Create an Amazon CloudWatch dashboard that has custom widgets that invoke AWS Lambda functions. Configure the Lambda functions to\nquery the workload metrics data from the Amazon Athena views.\n错误：CloudWatch仪表板主要用于监控，而不是用于复杂的数据分析和可视化。QuickSight更适合此场景。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nC\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nC\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
