    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon S3跨区域复制（Cross-Region Replication, CRR）和双向复制的实现。\nAmazon DynamoDB全球表（Global Tables）的使用。\n数据跨区域同步的最佳实践。\n操作效率和自动化的实现。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Implement two-way S3 bucket replication between the primary Region's S3 buckets and the secondary Region’s S3 buckets. Convert the\nDynamoDB tables into global tables. Set the secondary Region as the additional Region.\n正确：双向S3存储桶复制可以确保S3数据在两个区域之间自动同步。\n正确：DynamoDB全球表允许跨区域数据复制，且数据会立即传播到所有区域。\n正确：此方案完全自动化，操作效率最高，符合题目要求。\nB. Implement S3 Batch Operations copy jobs between the primary Region and the secondary Region for all S3 buckets. Convert the DynamoDB\ntables into global tables. Set the secondary Region as the additional Region.\n错误：S3 Batch Operations是手动触发的批量操作，不是实时同步，无法满足“数据必须立即传播”的要求。\n正确：DynamoDB全球表可以满足跨区域数据同步的需求。\n错误：整体方案的操作效率较低，不符合题目要求。\nC. Implement two-way S3 bucket replication between the primary Region's S3 buckets and the secondary Region's S3 buckets. Enable\nDynamoDB streams on the DynamoDB tables in both Regions. In each Region, create an AWS Lambda function that subscribes to the DynamoDB streams. Configure the Lambda function to copy new records to the DynamoDB tables in the other Region.\n正确：双向S3存储桶复制可以确保S3数据在两个区域之间自动同步。\n错误：使用DynamoDB Streams和Lambda函数手动复制数据的方式复杂且效率较低，不如直接使用DynamoDB全球表。\n错误：整体方案的操作效率较低，不符合题目要求。\nD. Implement S3 Batch Operations copy jobs between the primary Region and the secondary Region for all S3 buckets. Enable DynamoDB\nstreams on the DynamoDB tables in both Regions. In each Region, create an AWS Lambda function that subscribes to the DynamoDB streams. Configure the Lambda function to copy new records to the DynamoDB tables in the other Region.\n错误：S3 Batch Operations是手动触发的批量操作，不是实时同步，无法满足“数据必须立即传播”的要求。\n错误：使用DynamoDB Streams和Lambda函数手动复制数据的方式复杂且效率较低，不如直接使用DynamoDB全球表。\n错误：整体方案的操作效率较低，不符合题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n一致：我的答案与官方答案相同，选择A。\n原因：选项A提供了最符合题目要求的解决方案，既满足数据立即传播的需求，又具有最高的操作效率。",
