    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n灾难恢复（Disaster Recovery）策略，包括RPO（恢复点目标）和RTO（恢复时间目标） 。\nAmazon Aurora 的全球数据库功能及其故障转移能力。\n跨区域部署应用程序的高可用性架构设计。\nAmazon Route 53 和AWS Global Accelerator 的故障转移和流量管理功能。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon Aurora Single-AZ cluster in multiple AWS Regions as the data store. Use Aurora's automatic recovery capabilities in the\nevent of a disaster.\n错误：Amazon Aurora Single-AZ 集群不提供跨区域的高可用性，且无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。单区域部署在灾难情况下恢复时间较长，无法保证10 分钟的RTO。\nB. Create an Amazon Aurora global database in two AWS Regions as the data store. In the event of a failure, promote the secondary Region to\nthe primary for the application. Update the application to use the Aurora cluster endpoint in the secondary Region.\n正确：Amazon Aurora 全球数据库支持跨区域复制，复制延迟通常在秒级，能够满足2 小时的RPO 要求。在故障情况下，可以快速提升辅助区域为主区域，满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\nC. Create an Amazon Aurora cluster in multiple AWS Regions as the data store. Use a Network Load Balancer to balance the database traffic in\ndifferent Regions.\n错误：Aurora 集群本身不支持跨区域的负载均衡，Network Load Balancer 主要用于处理网络流量，而不是数据库流量。此选项无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nD. Set up the application in two AWS Regions. Use Amazon Route 53 failover routing that points to Application Load Balancers in both Regions.\nUse health checks and Auto Scaling groups in each Region.\n正确：通过在两个区域部署应用程序并使用Route 53 故障转移路由，可以实现快速切换到健康的区域，满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\nAuto Scaling 组和健康检查确保应用程序的高可用性。\nE. Set up the application in two AWS Regions. Configure AWS Global Accelerator to point to Application Load Balancers (ALBs) in both Regions.\nAdd both ALBs to a single endpoint group. Use health checks and Auto Scaling groups in each Region.\n错误：虽然AWS Global Accelerator 提供低延迟的全球流量管理，但它主要用于优化流量路由，而不是灾难恢复。此选项未明确提到如何满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\nD\n4. 官方答案\nB\nD\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n灾难恢复（Disaster Recovery）策略，包括RPO（恢复点目标）和RTO（恢复时间目标） 。\nAmazon Aurora 的全球数据库功能及其故障转移能力。\n跨区域部署应用程序的高可用性架构设计。\nAmazon Route 53 和AWS Global Accelerator 的故障转移和流量管理功能。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon Aurora Single-AZ cluster in multiple AWS Regions as the data store. Use Aurora's automatic recovery capabilities in the\nevent of a disaster.\n错误：Amazon Aurora Single-AZ 集群不提供跨区域的高可用性，且无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。单区域部署在灾难情况下恢复时间较长，无法保证10 分钟的RTO。\nB. Create an Amazon Aurora global database in two AWS Regions as the data store. In the event of a failure, promote the secondary Region to\nthe primary for the application. Update the application to use the Aurora cluster endpoint in the secondary Region.\n正确：Amazon Aurora 全球数据库支持跨区域复制，复制延迟通常在秒级，能够满足2 小时的RPO 要求。在故障情况下，可以快速提升辅助区域为主区域，满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\nC. Create an Amazon Aurora cluster in multiple AWS Regions as the data store. Use a Network Load Balancer to balance the database traffic in\ndifferent Regions.\n错误：Aurora 集群本身不支持跨区域的负载均衡，Network Load Balancer 主要用于处理网络流量，而不是数据库流量。此选项无法满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\nD. Set up the application in two AWS Regions. Use Amazon Route 53 failover routing that points to Application Load Balancers in both Regions.\nUse health checks and Auto Scaling groups in each Region.\n正确：通过在两个区域部署应用程序并使用Route 53 故障转移路由，可以实现快速切换到健康的区域，满足10 分钟的RTO 要求。\nAuto Scaling 组和健康检查确保应用程序的高可用性。\nE. Set up the application in two AWS Regions. Configure AWS Global Accelerator to point to Application Load Balancers (ALBs) in both Regions.\nAdd both ALBs to a single endpoint group. Use health checks and Auto Scaling groups in each Region.\n错误：虽然AWS Global Accelerator 提供低延迟的全球流量管理，但它主要用于优化流量路由，而不是灾难恢复。此选项未明确提到如何满足RPO 和RTO 要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\nD\n4. 官方答案\nB\nD\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
    "answerConfidence": "pdf",
    "answerFixed": false
