    "stemEn": "A company wants to use AWS Systems Manager documents to bootstrap physical laptops for developers. The bootstrap code is stored in GitHub. A DevOps engineer has already created a Systems Manager activation, installed the Systems Manager agent with the registration code, and installed an activation ID on all the laptops. Which set of steps should be taken next?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司希望使用AWS Systems Manager 文档来为开发人员的物理笔记本电脑进行引导。引导代码存储在GitHub 中。一位DevOps 工程师已经创建了一个Systems Manager 激活，安装了带有注册代码的Systems Manager agent，并在所有笔记本电脑上安装了激活ID。接下来应该采取哪些步骤？",
