    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nIAM角色和策略的配置与权限管理。\nCloudFormation服务角色的使用和信任策略配置。\n如何限制开发人员的权限以确保资源只能通过CloudFormation进行管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Remove the AdministratorAccess policy. Assign the ReadOnlyAccess managed IAM policy to the developer role. Instruct the developers to\nuse the CloudFormationDeployment role as a CloudFormation service role when the developers deploy new stacks.\n正确：移除开发人员的AdministratorAccess权限并分配ReadOnlyAccess权限可以限制开发人员直接操作资源的能力。\n正确：指示开发人员使用CloudFormationDeployment角色作为CloudFormation服务角色可以确保资源只能通过CloudFormation进行管理。\nB. Update the trust policy of the CloudFormationDeployment role to allow the developer IAM role to assume the CloudFormationDeployment\nrole.\n错误：此选项允许开发人员直接假设CloudFormationDeployment角色，这与题目要求的“只能通过CloudFormation管理资源”相冲突。\nC. Configure the developer IAM role to be able to get and pass the CloudFormationDeployment role if iam:PassedToService equals. Configure\nthe CloudFormationDeployment role to allow all cloudformation actions for all resources.\n错误：此选项没有明确限制开发人员的权限，且未正确配置信任策略以确保只有CloudFormation可以使用该角色。\nD. Update the trust policy of the CloudFormationDeployment role to allow the cloudformation.amazonaws.com AWS principal to perform the\niam:AssumeRole action.\n正确：更新信任策略以允许CloudFormation服务主体（cloudformation.amazonaws.com）执行iam:AssumeRole操作，可以确保只有CloudFormation可以使用该角色。\nE. Remove the AdministratorAccess policy. Assign the ReadOnlyAccess managed IAM policy to the developer role. Instruct the developers to\nassume the CloudFormationDeployment role when the developers deploy new stacks.\n错误：此选项允许开发人员直接假设CloudFormationDeployment角色，这与题目要求的“只能通过CloudFormation管理资源”相冲突。\nF. Add an IAM policy to the CloudFormationDeployment role to allow cloudformation:* on all resources. Add a policy that allows the\niam:PassRole action for the ARN of the CloudFormationDeployment role if iam:PassedToService equals cloudformation.amazonaws.com.\n正确：为CloudFormationDeployment角色添加策略以允许cloudformation:*操作可以确保CloudFormation有足够的权限管理资源。\n正确：添加iam:PassRole策略并限制iam:PassedToService为cloudformation.amazonaws.com可以确保只有CloudFormation可以传递该角色。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nD\nF\n4. 官方答案\nA\nD\nF\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
