    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是AWS CodeDeploy的应用规范文件（appspec.yml）的配置规则，特别是文件的部署路径和映射关系。\n理解appspec.yml文件中files部分的source和destination字段的作用。\n2. 选项分析\nA. The config.txt file will be deployed to only /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n错误。根据appspec.yml文件的配置，config/config.txt的destination明确指定为/usr/local/src/config.txt，而不是/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n正确。config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，同时source: /会将整个代码库的内容（包括config/config.txt）复制到/var/www/html，因此config/config.txt也会出现在/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nC. The config.txt file will be deployed to only /usr/local/src/config.txt.\n错误。虽然config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，但source: /会将整个代码库的内容复制到/var/www/html，因此config/config.txt也会出现在/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nD. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/application/web/config.txt.\n错误。虽然config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，但source: /会将整个代码库的内容复制到/var/www/html，而不是/var/www/html/application/web/config.txt。\n3. 我选的答案\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n4. 官方答案\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析正确，符合appspec.yml文件的配置规则。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是AWS CodeDeploy的应用规范文件（appspec.yml）的配置规则，特别是文件的部署路径和映射关系。\n理解appspec.yml文件中files部分的source和destination字段的作用。\n2. 选项分析\nA. The config.txt file will be deployed to only /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n错误。根据appspec.yml文件的配置，config/config.txt的destination明确指定为/usr/local/src/config.txt，而不是/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n正确。config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，同时source: /会将整个代码库的内容（包括config/config.txt）复制到/var/www/html，因此config/config.txt也会出现在/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nC. The config.txt file will be deployed to only /usr/local/src/config.txt.\n错误。虽然config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，但source: /会将整个代码库的内容复制到/var/www/html，因此config/config.txt也会出现在/var/www/html/config/config.txt。\nD. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/application/web/config.txt.\n错误。虽然config/config.txt被明确映射到/usr/local/src/config.txt，但source: /会将整个代码库的内容复制到/var/www/html，而不是/var/www/html/application/web/config.txt。\n3. 我选的答案\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n4. 官方答案\nB. The config.txt file will be deployed to /usr/local/src/config.txt and to /var/www/html/config/config.txt.\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析正确，符合appspec.yml文件的配置规则。",
