        "textEn": "For the critical data, modify the existing Auto Scaling group. Create a warm pool instance in the stopped state. Define the warm pool size. Create a new version of the launch template that has detailed monitoring enabled. Use On-Demand Instances.",
        "textZh": "对于关键数据，修改现有的Auto Scaling 组。创建一个处于停止状态的warm pool 实例。定义warm pool 的大小。创建一个启用详细监控的新版本启动模板。使用On-Demand Instances。",
