        "textEn": "For the critical data, modify the existing Auto Scaling group. Create a lifecycle hook to ensure that bootstrap scripts are completed successfully. Ensure that the application on the instances is ready to accept traffic before the instances are registered. Create a new version of the launch template that has detailed monitoring enabled.",
        "textZh": "对于关键数据，修改现有的Auto Scaling 组。创建一个生命周期挂钩，以确保引导脚本成功完成。确保实例上的应用程序在实例注册之前已准备好接受流量。创建一个启用详细监控的新版本启动模板。"
