        "textEn": "For the noncritical data, create a second Auto Scaling group that uses a launch template. Configure the launch template to install the unified Amazon CloudWatch agent and to configure the CloudWatch agent with a custom memory utilization metric. Use Spot Instances. Add the new Auto Scaling group as the target group for the ALB. Modify the application to use two target groups for critical data and noncritical data.",
        "textZh": "对于非关键数据，创建第二个Auto Scaling 组，该组使用一个启动模板。配置启动模板以安装统一的Amazon CloudWatch agent，并使用自定义内存利用率指标配置CloudWatch agent。使用Spot Instances。将新的Auto Scaling 组作为ALB 的目标组。修改应用程序以使用两个目标组分别处理关键数据和非关键数据。",
