    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon EKS集群的监控与性能优化。\n如何使用Amazon CloudWatch收集和分析指标。\nIAM策略的配置与权限管理。\n部署CloudWatch Agent和相关工具以收集性能数据。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Attach the CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy managed IAM policy to the IAM instance profile that the cluster uses.\n正确：此选项允许EC2实例上的CloudWatch Agent收集和发送指标到CloudWatch。需要为实例配置适当的IAM权限。\nB. Attach the CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy managed IAM policy to a service account role for the cluster.\n错误：此选项提到将策略附加到服务账户角色，但题目中并未提到需要使用Kubernetes服务账户角色来收集指标。\nC. Collect performance metrics by deploying the unified Amazon CloudWatch agent to the existing EC2 instances in the cluster. Add the agent to the AMI for any new EC2 instances that are added to the cluster.\n正确：部署CloudWatch Agent是收集性能指标的关键步骤。将Agent添加到AMI确保新实例也能自动收集指标。\nD. Collect performance logs by deploying the AWS Distro for OpenTelemetry collector as a DaemonSet.\n错误：OpenTelemetry主要用于分布式追踪和日志收集，而题目要求收集内存指标，CloudWatch Agent更适合此场景。\nE. Analyze the pod_memory_utilization Amazon CloudWatch metric in the ContainerInsights namespace by using the Service dimension.正确：Container Insights提供了pod级别的内存指标，使用Service维度可以分析特定服务的内存使用情况。\nF. Analyze the node_memory_utilization Amazon CloudWatch metric in the ContainerInsights namespace by using the ClusterName dimension.错误：虽然node_memory_utilization提供节点级别的内存指标，但题目要求分析应用的内存使用情况，pod_memory_utilization更符合需求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nC\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nC\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon EKS集群的监控与性能优化。\n如何使用Amazon CloudWatch收集和分析指标。\nIAM策略的配置与权限管理。\n部署CloudWatch Agent和相关工具以收集性能数据。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Attach the CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy managed IAM policy to the IAM instance profile that the cluster uses.\n正确：此选项允许EC2实例上的CloudWatch Agent收集和发送指标到CloudWatch。需要为实例配置适当的IAM权限。\nB. Attach the CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy managed IAM policy to a service account role for the cluster.\n错误：此选项提到将策略附加到服务账户角色，但题目中并未提到需要使用Kubernetes服务账户角色来收集指标。\nC. Collect performance metrics by deploying the unified Amazon CloudWatch agent to the existing EC2 instances in the cluster. Add the agent to the AMI for any new EC2 instances that are added to the cluster.\n正确：部署CloudWatch Agent是收集性能指标的关键步骤。将Agent添加到AMI确保新实例也能自动收集指标。\nD. Collect performance logs by deploying the AWS Distro for OpenTelemetry collector as a DaemonSet.\n错误：OpenTelemetry主要用于分布式追踪和日志收集，而题目要求收集内存指标，CloudWatch Agent更适合此场景。\nE. Analyze the pod_memory_utilization Amazon CloudWatch metric in the ContainerInsights namespace by using the Service dimension.正确：Container Insights提供了pod级别的内存指标，使用Service维度可以分析特定服务的内存使用情况。\nF. Analyze the node_memory_utilization Amazon CloudWatch metric in the ContainerInsights namespace by using the ClusterName dimension.错误：虽然node_memory_utilization提供节点级别的内存指标，但题目要求分析应用的内存使用情况，pod_memory_utilization更符合需求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nC\nE\n4. 官方答案\nA\nC\nE\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
