    "communityVotes": null,
    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon S3跨区域复制（Cross-Region Replication）和双向复制的配置。\nS3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) 的使用。\nAmazon S3 Multi-Region Access Point 的配置和故障转移机制。\n如何使用AWS API进行故障转移操作。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Enable S3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) on each replication rule. 正确。S3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) 确保跨区域复制的延迟\n在15分钟内完成，符合题目要求。\nB. Create an S3 Multi-Region Access Point in an active-passive configuration. 正确。S3 Multi-Region Access Point 提供了跨区域访问的能\n力，并支持主动-被动配置，适合故障转移场景。\nC. Call the SubmitMultiRegionAccessPointRoutes operation in the AWS API when the company needs to fail over to the S3 bucket in the other\nRegion. 正确。SubmitMultiRegionAccessPointRoutes API 用于更新Multi-Region Access Point 的路由，支持故障转移到另一个区域的S3 bucket。\nD. Enable S3 Transfer Acceleration on both S3 buckets. 错误。S3 Transfer Acceleration 用于加速数据上传到S3，但与跨区域复制和故障转\n移无关。\nE. Configure a routing control in Amazon Route 53 Recovery Controller. Add the S3 buckets in an active-passive configuration. 错误。Route 53\nRecovery Controller 主要用于DNS级别的故障转移，与S3的跨区域复制和访问点无直接关系。\nF. Call the UpdateRoutingControlStates operation in the AWS API when the company needs to fail over to the S3 bucket in the other Region. 错\n误。UpdateRoutingControlStates API 是用于Route 53 Recovery Controller的操作，与S3的故障转移机制无关。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nB\nC\n4. 官方答案\nA\nB\nC\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon S3跨区域复制（Cross-Region Replication）和双向复制的配置。\nS3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) 的使用。\nAmazon S3 Multi-Region Access Point 的配置和故障转移机制。\n如何使用AWS API进行故障转移操作。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Enable S3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) on each replication rule. 正确。S3 Replication Time Control (S3 RTC) 确保跨区域复制的延迟\n在15分钟内完成，符合题目要求。\nB. Create an S3 Multi-Region Access Point in an active-passive configuration. 正确。S3 Multi-Region Access Point 提供了跨区域访问的能\n力，并支持主动-被动配置，适合故障转移场景。\nC. Call the SubmitMultiRegionAccessPointRoutes operation in the AWS API when the company needs to fail over to the S3 bucket in the other\nRegion. 正确。SubmitMultiRegionAccessPointRoutes API 用于更新Multi-Region Access Point 的路由，支持故障转移到另一个区域的S3 bucket。\nD. Enable S3 Transfer Acceleration on both S3 buckets. 错误。S3 Transfer Acceleration 用于加速数据上传到S3，但与跨区域复制和故障转\n移无关。\nE. Configure a routing control in Amazon Route 53 Recovery Controller. Add the S3 buckets in an active-passive configuration. 错误。Route 53\nRecovery Controller 主要用于DNS级别的故障转移，与S3的跨区域复制和访问点无直接关系。\nF. Call the UpdateRoutingControlStates operation in the AWS API when the company needs to fail over to the S3 bucket in the other Region. 错\n误。UpdateRoutingControlStates API 是用于Route 53 Recovery Controller的操作，与S3的故障转移机制无关。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nB\nC\n4. 官方答案\nA\nB\nC\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
