        "textEn": "Create an AWS Lambda function to transform the data and to write a new object to the existing S3 bucket. Configure the Lambda function with an S3 trigger for the existing S3 bucket. Specify all object create events for the event type. Acknowledge the recursive invocation.",
        "textZh": "创建一个AWS Lambda 函数以转换数据并将新的对象写入现有的S3 存储桶。为现有的S3 存储桶配置Lambda 函数的S3 触发器。指定事件类型的所有对象创建事件。确认递归调用。"
