        "textEn": "Enable Amazon EventBridge notifications on the existing S3 bucket. Create a custom EventBridge event bus. Create an EventBridge rule that is associated with the custom event bus. Configure the rule to react to all object create events for the existing S3 bucket and to invoke an AWS Step Functions workflow. Configure a Step Functions task to transform the data and to write the data into a new S3 bucket.",
        "textZh": "启用现有S3 存储桶上的Amazon EventBridge 通知。创建一个自定义EventBridge 事件总线。创建一个与自定义事件总线关联的EventBridge 规则。将规则配置为对现有S3 存储桶的所有对象创建事件做出反应，并调用AWS Step Functions 工作流。配置Step Functions 任务以转换数据并将数据写入新的S3 存储桶。"
