        "textEn": "In the organization's management account, update the SCP condition reference to the ARN of the DevOps team's group role to include the AWS account ID of the organization's management account.",
        "textZh": "在组织的管理账户中，更新SCP 条件引用到DevOps 团队组角色的ARN，以包含组织管理账户的AWS 账户ID。"
