    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon SQS队列的监控指标，包括ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible和ApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed。\nAmazon CloudWatch的使用，包括创建指标警报和配置通知。\nAmazon SNS的集成，用于发送警报通知。\n高效的自动化监控解决方案设计。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon CloudWatch metric alarm with a period of 1 hour and a static threshold to alarm if the average of the\nApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed metric is greater than the expected value. Configure the alarm to notify the SNS topic.\n错误：ApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed表示队列中延迟的消息数量，但题目要求监控队列的大小，而不是延迟的消息数量。\n虽然可以设置警报，但此指标并不能准确反映队列的整体大小，因此不符合题目要求。\nB. Create an Amazon CloudWatch metric alarm with a period of 1 hour and a static threshold to alarm if the sum of the\nApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible metric is greater than the expected value. Configure the alarm to notify the SNS topic.\n正确：ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible表示队列中可见的消息数量，直接反映了队列的大小。\n使用CloudWatch指标警报和SNS通知是高效的解决方案，符合题目要求。\nC. Create an AWS Lambda function that retrieves the ApproximateNumberOfMessages SQS queue attribute value and publishes the value as a\nnew CloudWatch custom metric. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that is scheduled to run every 5 minutes and that invokes the Lambda function. Configure a CloudWatch metrics alarm with a period of 1 hour and a static threshold to alarm if the sum of the new custom metric is greater than the expected value.\n错误：此解决方案过于复杂，需要额外创建Lambda函数和自定义CloudWatch指标。\n虽然可以实现目标，但与选项B相比，操作效率较低。\nD. Create an AWS Lambda function that checks the ApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed SQS queue attribute and compares the value to a\ndefined expected size in the function. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that is scheduled to run every 5 minutes and that invokes the Lambda function. When the ApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed SQS queue attribute exceeds the expected size, send a notification the SNS topic.\n错误：此解决方案依赖Lambda函数和EventBridge规则，增加了复杂性。\nApproximateNumberOfMessagesDelayed并不直接反映队列的大小，因此不符合题目要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nB\n4. 官方答案\nB\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n选项B是最符合题目要求且具有最高操作效率的解决方案。",
