        "text": "Create a new CodeBuild project. Configure the project to run a security scan on the code by using Amazon CodeGuru Security. Configure the CodeBuild project to raise an error if CodeGuru Security finds vulnerabilities. Create a new IAM role that has sufficient permissions to run CodeGuru Security scans. Assign the role to the CodeBuild project. In the CodePipeline pipeline, add a new stage before the deployment stage. Select AWS CodeBuild as the action provider for the new stage. Use the source artifact from the CodeCommit repository. Configure the action to use the CodeBuild project.",
        "textEn": "Create a new CodeBuild project. Configure the project to run a security scan on the code by using Amazon CodeGuru Security. Configure the CodeBuild project to raise an error if CodeGuru Security finds vulnerabilities. Create a new IAM role that has sufficient permissions to run CodeGuru Security scans. Assign the role to the CodeBuild project. In the CodePipeline pipeline, add a new stage before the deployment stage. Select AWS CodeBuild as the action provider for the new stage. Use the source artifact from the CodeCommit repository. Configure the action to use the CodeBuild project.",
        "textZh": "创建一个新的CodeBuild 项目。配置该项目使用Amazon CodeGuru Security 对代码进行安全扫描。如果CodeGuru Security 发现漏洞，则配置CodeBuild 项目引发错误。创建一个具有运行CodeGuru Security 扫描所需权限的新IAM 角色。将该角色分配给CodeBuild 项目。在CodePipeline 管道中，在部署阶段之前添加一个新阶段。选择AWS CodeBuild 作为新阶段的操作提供者。使用来自CodeCommit 存储库的源工件。配置操作以使用CodeBuild 项目。",
