    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Systems Manager的自动化管理功能。\nIAM角色与策略的配置。\n如何确保新创建的EC2实例自动被Systems Manager管理。\n操作效率与自动化最佳实践。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an IAM role that has a trust policy that allows Systems Manager to assume the role. Attach the\nAmazonSSMManagedEC2InstanceDefaultPolicy policy to the role. Configure the default-ec2-instance-management-role SSM service setting to use the role.分析：\n此选项直接通过配置SSM服务设置（default-ec2-instance-management-role）来确保所有新创建的EC2实例自动被Systems Manager管理。\nAmazonSSMManagedEC2InstanceDefaultPolicy是专门设计用于管理EC2实例的策略，确保实例可以与Systems Manager交互。\n此方法操作效率高，完全自动化，无需额外的手动干预。\n正确选项。\nB. Ensure that AWS Config is set up. Create an AWS Config rule that validates if an EC2 instance has SSM Agent installed. Configure the rule to\nrun on EC2 configuration changes. Configure automatic remediation for the rule to run the AWS-InstallSSMAgent SSM document to install SSM Agent.分析：\n此选项依赖AWS Config规则来验证SSM Agent是否安装，并通过自动修复来安装SSM Agent。\n虽然可以实现目标，但需要额外的配置和维护AWS Config规则，增加了复杂性。\n操作效率较低，不是最佳解决方案。\n错误选项。\nC. Configure Systems Manager Patch Manager. Create a patch baseline that automatically installs SSM Agent on all new EC2 instances. Create\na patch group for all EC2 instances. Attach the patch baseline to the patch group. Create a maintenance window and maintenance window task to start installing SSM Agent daily.分析：\n此选项使用Patch Manager来安装SSM Agent，但需要创建补丁基线、补丁组和维护窗口。\n这种方法适用于定期更新和补丁管理，但不适合确保新创建的EC2实例立即被管理。\n操作效率较低，且不符合题目要求的“自动管理”目标。\n错误选项。\nD. Create an EC2 instance role that has a trust policy that allows Amazon EC2 to assume the role. Attach the AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore\npolicy to the role. Ensure that AWS Config is set up. Use the ec2-instance-profile-attached managed AWS Config rule to validate if an EC2 instance has the role attached. Configure the rule to run on EC2 configuration changes. Configure automatic remediation for the rule to run the AWS-SetupManagedRoleOnEc2Instance SSM document to attach the role to the EC2 instance.分析：\n此选项依赖AWS Config规则来验证EC2实例是否附加了正确的IAM角色，并通过自动修复来附加角色。\n虽然可以实现目标，但需要额外的配置和维护AWS Config规则，增加了复杂性。\n操作效率较低，不是最佳解决方案。\n错误选项。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因：选项A提供了最直接、自动化且高效的解决方案，符合题目要求。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAWS Systems Manager的自动化管理功能。\nIAM角色与策略的配置。\n如何确保新创建的EC2实例自动被Systems Manager管理。\n操作效率与自动化最佳实践。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an IAM role that has a trust policy that allows Systems Manager to assume the role. Attach the\nAmazonSSMManagedEC2InstanceDefaultPolicy policy to the role. Configure the default-ec2-instance-management-role SSM service setting to use the role.分析：\n此选项直接通过配置SSM服务设置（default-ec2-instance-management-role）来确保所有新创建的EC2实例自动被Systems Manager管理。\nAmazonSSMManagedEC2InstanceDefaultPolicy是专门设计用于管理EC2实例的策略，确保实例可以与Systems Manager交互。\n此方法操作效率高，完全自动化，无需额外的手动干预。\n正确选项。\nB. Ensure that AWS Config is set up. Create an AWS Config rule that validates if an EC2 instance has SSM Agent installed. Configure the rule to\nrun on EC2 configuration changes. Configure automatic remediation for the rule to run the AWS-InstallSSMAgent SSM document to install SSM Agent.分析：\n此选项依赖AWS Config规则来验证SSM Agent是否安装，并通过自动修复来安装SSM Agent。\n虽然可以实现目标，但需要额外的配置和维护AWS Config规则，增加了复杂性。\n操作效率较低，不是最佳解决方案。\n错误选项。\nC. Configure Systems Manager Patch Manager. Create a patch baseline that automatically installs SSM Agent on all new EC2 instances. Create\na patch group for all EC2 instances. Attach the patch baseline to the patch group. Create a maintenance window and maintenance window task to start installing SSM Agent daily.分析：\n此选项使用Patch Manager来安装SSM Agent，但需要创建补丁基线、补丁组和维护窗口。\n这种方法适用于定期更新和补丁管理，但不适合确保新创建的EC2实例立即被管理。\n操作效率较低，且不符合题目要求的“自动管理”目标。\n错误选项。\nD. Create an EC2 instance role that has a trust policy that allows Amazon EC2 to assume the role. Attach the AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore\npolicy to the role. Ensure that AWS Config is set up. Use the ec2-instance-profile-attached managed AWS Config rule to validate if an EC2 instance has the role attached. Configure the rule to run on EC2 configuration changes. Configure automatic remediation for the rule to run the AWS-SetupManagedRoleOnEc2Instance SSM document to attach the role to the EC2 instance.分析：\n此选项依赖AWS Config规则来验证EC2实例是否附加了正确的IAM角色，并通过自动修复来附加角色。\n虽然可以实现目标，但需要额外的配置和维护AWS Config规则，增加了复杂性。\n操作效率较低，不是最佳解决方案。\n错误选项。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因：选项A提供了最直接、自动化且高效的解决方案，符合题目要求。",
