    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题主要考察AWS Control Tower的自动账户注册功能，以及如何通过API和IAM角色配置来实现自动化操作。\n涉及的服务包括AWS Control Tower、AWS Organizations、AWS Service Catalog、Amazon EventBridge和IAM角色管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge event that has an aws.controltower source and a CreateManagedAccount detail-type. Add the details of the\nnew AWS account to the detail field of the event.\n错误：AWS Control Tower不支持通过EventBridge事件直接创建托管账户。EventBridge事件通常用于监控和响应事件，而不是直接执行账户创建操作。\nB. Create an Amazon EventBridge event that has an aws.controltower source and a SetupLandingZone detail-type. Add the details of the new\nAWS account to the detail field of the event.\n错误：SetupLandingZone事件类型与账户创建无关，它用于设置AWS Control Tower的基础架构（Landing Zone） 。此选项与题目要求不符。\nC. Create an AWSControlTowerExecution role in the new AWS account. Configure the role to allow the AWS Control Tower administrator account\nto assume the role.\n正确：AWS Control Tower需要在新账户中创建AWSControlTowerExecution角色，以便管理员账户能够执行必要的操作。这是自动注册新账户的关键步骤之一。\nD. Call the AWS Service Catalog ProvisionProduct API operation with the details of the new AWS account.\n正确：AWS Control Tower使用AWS Service Catalog来管理账户创建和配置。调用ProvisionProduct API是注册新账户的正确方法。\nE. Call the Organizations EnableAWSServiceAccess API operation with the controltower.amazonaws.com service name and the details of the\nnew AWS account.\n错误：EnableAWSServiceAccess API用于启用服务访问，但它不是自动注册新账户的必要步骤。AWS Control Tower已经在组织中启用了相关服务访问。\n3. 我选的答案\nC\nD\n4. 官方答案\nC\nD\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题主要考察AWS Control Tower的自动账户注册功能，以及如何通过API和IAM角色配置来实现自动化操作。\n涉及的服务包括AWS Control Tower、AWS Organizations、AWS Service Catalog、Amazon EventBridge和IAM角色管理。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Create an Amazon EventBridge event that has an aws.controltower source and a CreateManagedAccount detail-type. Add the details of the\nnew AWS account to the detail field of the event.\n错误：AWS Control Tower不支持通过EventBridge事件直接创建托管账户。EventBridge事件通常用于监控和响应事件，而不是直接执行账户创建操作。\nB. Create an Amazon EventBridge event that has an aws.controltower source and a SetupLandingZone detail-type. Add the details of the new\nAWS account to the detail field of the event.\n错误：SetupLandingZone事件类型与账户创建无关，它用于设置AWS Control Tower的基础架构（Landing Zone） 。此选项与题目要求不符。\nC. Create an AWSControlTowerExecution role in the new AWS account. Configure the role to allow the AWS Control Tower administrator account\nto assume the role.\n正确：AWS Control Tower需要在新账户中创建AWSControlTowerExecution角色，以便管理员账户能够执行必要的操作。这是自动注册新账户的关键步骤之一。\nD. Call the AWS Service Catalog ProvisionProduct API operation with the details of the new AWS account.\n正确：AWS Control Tower使用AWS Service Catalog来管理账户创建和配置。调用ProvisionProduct API是注册新账户的正确方法。\nE. Call the Organizations EnableAWSServiceAccess API operation with the controltower.amazonaws.com service name and the details of the\nnew AWS account.\n错误：EnableAWSServiceAccess API用于启用服务访问，但它不是自动注册新账户的必要步骤。AWS Control Tower已经在组织中启用了相关服务访问。\n3. 我选的答案\nC\nD\n4. 官方答案\nC\nD\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
