    "stem": "一名DevOps 工程师使用托管节点组配置了一个Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 集群。该DevOps 工程师将一个OpenID Connect (OIDC) 发行者与集群关联起来。该DevOps 工程师正在为集群配置Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) 通用型SSD (gp3) 卷。DevOps 工程师尝试发起一个PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC) 请求，但无法配置卷。为了解决问题，DevOps 工程师运行了kubectl describe pyc 命令。DevOps 工程师收到一个failed to provision volume with StorageClass 错误和一个could not create volume in EC2:UnauthorizedOperation 错误。哪种解决方案可以解决这些错误？",
    "stemEn": "A DevOps engineer provisioned an Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) cluster with managed node groups. The DevOps engineer associated an OpenID Connect (OIDC) issuer with the cluster. The DevOps engineer is configuring Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) General Purpose SSD (gp3) volumes for the cluster. The DevOps engineer attempts to initiate a PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC) request but is unable to provision a volume. To troubleshoot the issue, the DevOps engineer runs the kubectl describe pyc command. The DevOps engineer receives a failed to provision volume with StorageClass error and a could not create volume in EC2:UnauthorizedOperation error. Which solution will resolve these errors?",
    "stemZh": "一名DevOps 工程师使用托管节点组配置了一个Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 集群。该DevOps 工程师将一个OpenID Connect (OIDC) 发行者与集群关联起来。该DevOps 工程师正在为集群配置Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) 通用型SSD (gp3) 卷。DevOps 工程师尝试发起一个PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC) 请求，但无法配置卷。为了解决问题，DevOps 工程师运行了kubectl describe pyc 命令。DevOps 工程师收到一个failed to provision volume with StorageClass 错误和一个could not create volume in EC2:UnauthorizedOperation 错误。哪种解决方案可以解决这些错误？",
