    "stemEn": "A company is using Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) to run its applications. The EKS cluster is successfully running multiple pods. The company stores the pod images in Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR). The company needs to configure Pod Identity access for the EKS cluster. The company has already updated the node IAM role by using the permissions for Pod Identity access. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司正在使用Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 来运行其应用程序。EKS 集群成功运行了多个pod。公司将pod 镜像存储在Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 中。公司需要为EKS 集群配置Pod Identity 访问。公司已经通过使用Pod Identity 访问权限更新了节点IAM 角色。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
