    "stemEn": "A company is running an internal application in an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) cluster on Amazon EC2. The ECS cluster instances can connect to the public internet. The ECS tasks that run on the cluster instances are configured to use images from both private Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) repositories and a public ECR registry repository. A new security policy requires the company to remove the ECS cluster's direct access to the internet. The company must remove any NAT gateways and internet gateways from the VPC that hosts the cluster. A DevOps engineer needs to ensure the ECS cluster can still download images from both the public ECR registry and the private ECR repositories. Images from the public ECR registry must remain up-to-date. New versions of the images must be available to the ECS cluster within 24 hours of publication. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead? (Choose three.)",
    "stemZh": "一家公司在Amazon EC2 上的Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 集群中运行一个内部应用程序。ECS 集群实例可以连接到公共互联网。运行在集群实例上的ECS 任务被配置为使用来自私有Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 存储库和公共ECR注册表存储库的镜像。新的安全策略要求公司移除ECS 集群对互联网的直接访问。公司必须从托管集群的VPC 中移除任何NAT 网关和互联网网关。一名DevOps 工程师需要确保ECS 集群仍然能够从公共ECR 注册表和私有ECR 存储库下载镜像。来自公共ECR 注册表的镜像必须保持最新状态。镜像的新版本必须在发布后24 小时内可供ECS 集群使用。哪种步骤组合能够以最少的操作开销满足这些要求？（选择三项）",
