    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Inspector的增强扫描功能及其与Amazon ECR的集成。\n使用Amazon EventBridge规则和Amazon SNS进行事件通知。\n如何实现自动化的容器镜像漏洞检测和通知机制。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Activate Amazon Inspector enhanced scanning for Amazon ECR. Configure the enhanced scanning to use continuous scanning. Set up a\ntopic in Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n正确：Amazon Inspector的增强扫描功能可以与Amazon ECR集成，用于持续扫描容器镜像的漏洞。\n正确：配置SNS主题可以实现自动通知，符合要求。\nB. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule for Amazon Inspector findings. Set an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic as the\nrule target.\n正确：EventBridge规则可以捕获Amazon Inspector的漏洞发现事件，并将其发送到SNS主题以通知安全团队。\n正确：这种方式减少了手动操作，符合“最少的操作开销”要求。\nC. Activate AWS Lambda enhanced scanning for Amazon ECR. Configure the enhanced scanning to use continuous scanning. Set up a topic in\nAmazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES).\n错误：AWS Lambda并没有增强扫描功能，增强扫描是Amazon Inspector的功能。\n错误：SES用于发送电子邮件通知，但题目中并未提到需要使用电子邮件通知。\nD. Create a new AWS Lambda function. Invoke the new Lambda function when scan findings are detected.\n错误：虽然可以使用Lambda函数处理扫描结果，但这增加了操作开销，不符合“最少的操作开销”要求。\nE. Activate default basic scanning for Amazon ECR for all container images. Configure the default basic scanning to use continuous scanning.\nSet up a topic in Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n错误：默认基本扫描功能的检测能力有限，无法满足快速识别漏洞的需求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nB\n4. 官方答案\nA\nB\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
