    "type": "choice",
    "stem": "一家公司通过使用Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 服务运行一个网站，该服务连接到一个Application Load Balancer (ALB)。该服务处于稳定状态，任务能够成功响应请求。一位DevOps 工程师使用新的容器镜像更新了任务定义，并将新的任务定义部署到服务中。该DevOps 工程师注意到，由于ALB 健康检查失败，服务频繁停止并启动新的任务。 DevOps 工程师应该如何排查失败的部署问题？",
    "stemEn": "A company runs a website by using an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) service that is connected to an Application Load Balancer (ALB). The service was in a steady state with tasks responding to requests successfully. A DevOps engineer updated the task definition with a new container image and deployed the new task definition to the service. The DevOps engineer noticed that the service is frequently stopping and starting new tasks because the ALB healtth checks are failing. What should the DevOps engineer do to troubleshoot the failed deployment?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司通过使用Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 服务运行一个网站，该服务连接到一个Application Load Balancer (ALB)。该服务处于稳定状态，任务能够成功响应请求。一位DevOps 工程师使用新的容器镜像更新了任务定义，并将新的任务定义部署到服务中。该DevOps 工程师注意到，由于ALB 健康检查失败，服务频繁停止并启动新的任务。 DevOps 工程师应该如何排查失败的部署问题？",
