        "textEn": "Use AWS Systems Manager to create a patch baseline for the default operating system repository and a second patch baseline for the custom repository. Run the AWS-RunPatchBaseline document by using the Run command to verify and install patches. Use the BaselineOverride API to configure the default patch baseline and the custom patch baseline.",
        "textZh": "使用AWS Systems Manager 为默认操作系统存储库创建一个补丁基线，并为自定义存储库创建第二个补丁基线。通过使用Run 命令运行AWS-RunPatchBaseline 文档来验证和安装补丁。使用BaselineOverride API 配置默认补丁基线和自定义补丁基线。"
