    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nCodeDeploy 部署策略的配置，包括Canary 和Linear 部署方式。\n使用Amazon CloudWatch 监控指标并与CodeDeploy 集成以实现自动回滚。\n如何监控应用性能指标（如响应时间）以确保部署的稳定性。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Modify the CodeDeploy deployment to use the CodeDeployDefault.ECSCanary10Percent5Minutes configuration.\n正确：Canary 部署策略允许逐步将流量切换到新版本，初始阶段仅将10% 的流量切换到新版本，并在5 分钟后评估性能。这种方式可以有效监控新版本的表现，减少风险。\nB. Modify the CodeDeploy deployment to use the CodeDeployDefault.ECSLinear10PercentEvery3Minutes configuration.\n错误：Linear 部署策略逐步增加流量，但在问题发生时可能需要更长时间才能发现问题。题目要求快速监控和回滚，因此Canary 部署更适合。\nC. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the UnHealthyHostCount metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is higher\nthan the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when a deployment fails.\n错误：UnHealthyHostCount 监控的是负载均衡器中不健康的目标数量，这与题目中提到的“响应时间”问题无关，因此不符合要求。\nD. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the TargetResponseTime metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is higher\nthan the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when alarm thresholds are met.\n正确：TargetResponseTime 是监控应用响应时间的关键指标。通过设置CloudWatch 警报并与CodeDeploy 集成，可以在响应时间超过阈值时自动回滚部署，符合题目要求。\nE. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the TargetConnectionErrorCount metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is\nhigher than the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when alarm thresholds are met.\n错误：TargetConnectionErrorCount 监控的是连接错误数量，与题目中提到的“响应时间”问题无关，因此不符合要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nD\n4. 官方答案\nA\nD\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nCodeDeploy 部署策略的配置，包括Canary 和Linear 部署方式。\n使用Amazon CloudWatch 监控指标并与CodeDeploy 集成以实现自动回滚。\n如何监控应用性能指标（如响应时间）以确保部署的稳定性。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Modify the CodeDeploy deployment to use the CodeDeployDefault.ECSCanary10Percent5Minutes configuration.\n正确：Canary 部署策略允许逐步将流量切换到新版本，初始阶段仅将10% 的流量切换到新版本，并在5 分钟后评估性能。这种方式可以有效监控新版本的表现，减少风险。\nB. Modify the CodeDeploy deployment to use the CodeDeployDefault.ECSLinear10PercentEvery3Minutes configuration.\n错误：Linear 部署策略逐步增加流量，但在问题发生时可能需要更长时间才能发现问题。题目要求快速监控和回滚，因此Canary 部署更适合。\nC. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the UnHealthyHostCount metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is higher\nthan the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when a deployment fails.\n错误：UnHealthyHostCount 监控的是负载均衡器中不健康的目标数量，这与题目中提到的“响应时间”问题无关，因此不符合要求。\nD. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the TargetResponseTime metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is higher\nthan the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when alarm thresholds are met.\n正确：TargetResponseTime 是监控应用响应时间的关键指标。通过设置CloudWatch 警报并与CodeDeploy 集成，可以在响应时间超过阈值时自动回滚部署，符合题目要求。\nE. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm to monitor the TargetConnectionErrorCount metric for the ALB. Set the alarm to activate if the metric is\nhigher than the desired value. Associate the alarm with the CodeDeploy deployment group. Modify the deployment group to roll back when alarm thresholds are met.\n错误：TargetConnectionErrorCount 监控的是连接错误数量，与题目中提到的“响应时间”问题无关，因此不符合要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\nD\n4. 官方答案\nA\nD\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
