        "textEn": "Configure a CloudWatch metrics stream to include all the metrics and to deliver the metrics to an Amazon Data Firehose delivery stream. Configure the Firehose delivery stream to invoke an AWS Lambda function to transform the data. Configure the delivery stream to send the transformed data to the S3 bucket.",
        "textZh": "配置一个CloudWatch 指标流，以包含所有指标并将指标传输到一个Amazon Data Firehose 传输流。将Firehose 传输流配置为调用一个AWS Lambda 函数来转换数据。将传输流配置为把转换后的数据发送到S3 存储桶。",
