    "stem": "一家公司使用HPC 平台运行数据分析任务。该公司使用AWS CodeBuild 创建容器镜像，并将镜像存储在Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR)。然后将这些镜像部署到Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 上。为了保持合规性，该公司需要确保镜像在部署到Amazon EKS 之前已被签名。签名密钥必须定期轮换，并且必须自动化管理。公司需要跟踪是谁生成了签名。哪种解决方案可以以最少的运营工作量满足这些需求？",
    "stemEn": "A company uses an HPC platform to run analysis jobs for data. The company uses AWS CodeBuild to create container images and store the images on Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR). The images are then deployed on Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS). To maintain compliance, the company needs to ensure that the images are signed before the images are deployed on Amazon EKS. The signing keys must be rotated periodically and must be managed automatically. The company needs to track who generates the signatures. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational effort?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司使用HPC 平台运行数据分析任务。该公司使用AWS CodeBuild 创建容器镜像，并将镜像存储在Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR)。然后将这些镜像部署到Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 上。为了保持合规性，该公司需要确保镜像在部署到Amazon EKS 之前已被签名。签名密钥必须定期轮换，并且必须自动化管理。公司需要跟踪是谁生成了签名。哪种解决方案可以以最少的运营工作量满足这些需求？",
