        "textEn": "Create an AWS CloudFormation stack set to enable an AWS CloudTrail trail to capture S3 data events for the organization. In the stack set, create an Amazon EventBridge rule to match S3 PutObject events that do not use AWS KMS encryption. Configure the rule to target an Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic.",
