        "textEn": "Create an SCP that includes a deny statement for the s3:putObject action and a condition where s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption is not aws:kms. Attach the SCP to the root of the organization.",
        "textZh": "创建一个SCP，其中包含一个针对s3:putObject 操作的deny 语句，以及一个条件，当s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption 不是aws:kms时生效。将SCP 附加到组织的根。"
