        "textEn": "Turn on Performance Insights in the existing Aurora PostrgreSQL DB cluster. Configure Amazon EventBridge to receive events from the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure the Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster to send notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).",
