    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Aurora PostgreSQL的性能监控与优化。\n使用AWS DevOps Guru进行问题检测与通知。\n使用Amazon SNS进行通知配置。\nVACUUM操作与长时间闲置事务对数据库性能的影响。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Turn on Performance Insights and DevOps Guru in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure DevOps Guru to send notifications to\nthe database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n正确：Performance Insights可以帮助监控数据库性能，识别问题。DevOps Guru可以自动检测数据库性能问题并提供建议。通过Amazon SNS发送通知是一个有效的方式，符合题目要求。\nB. Turn on Performance Insights in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure Amazon EventBridge to receive events from the\nexisting Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure the Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster to send notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n错误：虽然Performance Insights可以监控性能，但EventBridge主要用于事件驱动的架构，而不是直接用于数据库性能问题的检测和建议。题目要求的是主动检测问题并提供建议，EventBridge无法满足这一需求。\nC. Turn on Performance Insights and DevOps Guru in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure the Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster to\nsend notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES).\n错误：虽然Performance Insights和DevOps Guru是正确的选择，但使用Amazon SES发送通知不符合题目要求。题目明确提到使用Amazon SNS进行通知。\nD. Turn on Performance Insights in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure Amazon EventBridge to receive events from the\nexisting Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure DevOps Guru to send notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n错误：虽然使用Performance Insights和DevOps Guru是正确的，但EventBridge的使用不符合题目要求。题目没有提到需要通过EventBridge接收事件。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
    "explanationEn": "",
    "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAmazon Aurora PostgreSQL的性能监控与优化。\n使用AWS DevOps Guru进行问题检测与通知。\n使用Amazon SNS进行通知配置。\nVACUUM操作与长时间闲置事务对数据库性能的影响。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Turn on Performance Insights and DevOps Guru in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure DevOps Guru to send notifications to\nthe database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n正确：Performance Insights可以帮助监控数据库性能，识别问题。DevOps Guru可以自动检测数据库性能问题并提供建议。通过Amazon SNS发送通知是一个有效的方式，符合题目要求。\nB. Turn on Performance Insights in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure Amazon EventBridge to receive events from the\nexisting Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure the Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster to send notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n错误：虽然Performance Insights可以监控性能，但EventBridge主要用于事件驱动的架构，而不是直接用于数据库性能问题的检测和建议。题目要求的是主动检测问题并提供建议，EventBridge无法满足这一需求。\nC. Turn on Performance Insights and DevOps Guru in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure the Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster to\nsend notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES).\n错误：虽然Performance Insights和DevOps Guru是正确的选择，但使用Amazon SES发送通知不符合题目要求。题目明确提到使用Amazon SNS进行通知。\nD. Turn on Performance Insights in the existing Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure Amazon EventBridge to receive events from the\nexisting Aurora PostgreSQL DB cluster. Configure DevOps Guru to send notifications to the database team by using Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS).\n错误：虽然使用Performance Insights和DevOps Guru是正确的，但EventBridge的使用不符合题目要求。题目没有提到需要通过EventBridge接收事件。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
