    "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n灾难恢复(Disaster Recovery) 的设计与实现。\nAmazon CloudFront 的源故障切换功能。\n跨区域AMI 复制与Auto Scaling 配置。\nAmazon OpenSearch Service 的跨集群复制功能。\n成本优化与符合RTO 和RPO 要求的解决方案设计。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Add the new ALB as an origin in the CloudFront distribution. Configure origin failover functionality. Copy the AMI to the DR Region. Create a\nlaunch template and an Auto Scaling group with a desired capacity of 0 in the DR Region. Create a new OpenSearch Service cluster in the DR Region. Set up cross-cluster replication for the cluster.\n正确：使用CloudFront 的源故障切换功能可以在主区域不可用时自动切换到DR 区域，符合灾难恢复要求。\n正确：将AMI 复制到DR 区域并设置Auto Scaling 组的期望容量为0，可以在灾难发生时快速启动实例，同时降低日常成本。\n正确：创建新的OpenSearch Service 集群并设置跨集群复制，确保数据在两个区域之间同步，符合RPO 要求。\nB. Create a new CloudFront distribution in the DR Region and add the new ALB as an origin. Use Amazon Route 53 DNS for Regional failover.\nCopy the AMI to the DR Region. Create a launch template and an Auto Scaling group with a desired capacity of 0 in the DR Region. Reconfigure the OpenSearch Service cluster as a Multi-AZ with Standby deployment. Ensure that the standby nodes are in the DR Region.\n错误：创建新的CloudFront 分配会增加复杂性和成本，而不是利用现有的CloudFront 分配。\n错误：OpenSearch Service 的Multi-AZ 部署仅限于单个区域，无法跨区域实现备用节点。\n正确：使用Route 53 进行区域故障切换是有效的，但与题目要求的CloudFront 源故障切换功能不一致。\nC. Create a new CloudFront distribution in the DR Region and add the new ALB as an origin. Use Amazon Route 53 DNS for Regional failover.\nCopy the AMI to the DR Region. Create a launch template and an Auto Scaling group with a desired capacity of 3 in the DR Region. Reconfigure the OpenSearch Service cluster as a Multi-AZ with Standby deployment. Ensure that the standby nodes are in the DR Region.\n错误：创建新的CloudFront 分配会增加复杂性和成本，而不是利用现有的CloudFront 分配。\n错误：Auto Scaling 组的期望容量为3 会导致DR 区域的高成本，不符合“最小化成本”的要求。\n错误：OpenSearch Service 的Multi-AZ 部署仅限于单个区域，无法跨区域实现备用节点。\nD. Add the new ALB as an origin in the CloudFront distribution. Configure origin failover functionality. Copy the AMI to the DR Region. Create a\nlaunch template and an Auto Scaling group with a desired capacity of 3 in the DR Region. Create a new OpenSearch Service cluster in the DR Region. Set up cross-cluster replication for the cluster.\n正确：使用CloudFront 的源故障切换功能可以在主区域不可用时自动切换到DR 区域，符合灾难恢复要求。\n错误：Auto Scaling 组的期望容量为3 会导致DR 区域的高成本，不符合“最小化成本”的要求。\n正确：创建新的OpenSearch Service 集群并设置跨集群复制，确保数据在两个区域之间同步，符合RPO 要求。\n3. 我选的答案\nA\n4. 官方答案\nA\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
