    "stemEn": "A DevOps team operates an integration service that runs on an Amazon EC2 instance. The DevOps team uses Amazon Route 53 to manage the integration service's domain name by using a simple routing record. The integration service is stateful and uses Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) for data storage and state storage. The integration service does not support load balancing between multiple nodes. The DevOps team deploys the integration service on a new EC2 instance as a warm standby to reduce the mean time to recovery. The DevOps team wants the integration service to automatically fail over to the standby EC2 instance. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一个DevOps 团队运营一个运行在Amazon EC2 实例上的集成服务。DevOps 团队使用Amazon Route 53 通过简单路由记录来管理集成服务的域名。该集成服务是有状态的，并使用Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) 进行数据存储和状态存储。集成服务不支持在多个节点之间进行负载均衡。 DevOps 团队在一个新的EC2 实例上部署集成服务作为热备用，以减少平均恢复时间。DevOps 团队希望集成服务能够自动切换到备用EC2 实例。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
