    "stemEn": "A company wants to build a pipeline to update the standard AMI monthly. The AMI must be updated to use the most recent patches to ensure that launched Amazon EC2 instances are up to date. Each new AMI must be available to all AWS accounts in the company's organization in AWS Organizations. The company needs to configure an automated pipeline to build the AMI. Which solution will meet these requirements with the MOST operational efficiency?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司希望构建一个管道，每月更新标准AMI。该AMI 必须更新以使用最新的补丁，以确保启动的Amazon EC2 实例是最新的。每个新的AMI 必须对公司在AWS Organizations 中的所有AWS 账户可用。该公司需要配置一个自动化管道来构建AMI。哪种解决方案能够以最高的操作效率满足这些要求？",
