    "stem": "一名DevOps工程师成功创建了一个包含托管节点组的Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS)集群。当该DevOps工程师尝试向集群添加节点组时，集群返回了一个错误，提示“NodeCreationFailure: Instances failed to join the Kubernetes cluster.” DevOps工程师确认EC2工作节点正在运行，并且EKS集群处于活动状态。 DevOps工程师应该如何排查此问题？",
    "stemEn": "A DevOps engineer successfully creates an Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) cluster that includes managed node groups. When the DevOps engineer tries to add node groups to the cluster, the cluster returns an error that states, \"NodeCreationFailure: Instances failed to join the Kubernetes cluster.\" The DevOps engineer confirms that the EC2 worker nodes are running and that the EKS cluster is in an active state. How should the DevOps engineer troubleshoot this issue?",
    "stemZh": "一名DevOps工程师成功创建了一个包含托管节点组的Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS)集群。当该DevOps工程师尝试向集群添加节点组时，集群返回了一个错误，提示“NodeCreationFailure: Instances failed to join the Kubernetes cluster.” DevOps工程师确认EC2工作节点正在运行，并且EKS集群处于活动状态。 DevOps工程师应该如何排查此问题？",
