    "stem": "一家公司对运行在Amazon EC2 实例上的关键Web 应用程序设定了24 小时的RPO 和10 分钟的RTO。该公司使用AWS Organizations 来管理其AWS 账户。公司希望为其AWS 环境设置AWS Backup。一名DevOps 工程师为AWS Backup 配置了AWS Organizations。该工程师创建了一个新的集中式AWS 账户来存储备份。每个EC2 实例附加了四个Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) 卷。哪种解决方案将最安全地满足此要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company has an RPO of 24 hours and an RTO of 10 minutes for a critical web application that runs on Amazon EC2 instances. The company uses AWS Organizations to manage its AWS account. The company wants to set up AWS Backup for its AWS environment. A DevOps engineer configures AWS Organizations for AWS Backup. The DevOps engineer creates a new centralized AWS account to store the backups. Each EC2 instance has four Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) volumes attached. Which solution will meet this requirement MOST securely?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司对运行在Amazon EC2 实例上的关键Web 应用程序设定了24 小时的RPO 和10 分钟的RTO。该公司使用AWS Organizations 来管理其AWS 账户。公司希望为其AWS 环境设置AWS Backup。一名DevOps 工程师为AWS Backup 配置了AWS Organizations。该工程师创建了一个新的集中式AWS 账户来存储备份。每个EC2 实例附加了四个Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) 卷。哪种解决方案将最安全地满足此要求？",
