    "stemEn": "A company uses a CI/CD pipeline to deploy its workload in the ap-southeast-2 Region. The company receives images through a Network Load Balancer (NLB) and processes the images in AWS Fargate tasks on an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) cluster. An Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) repository stores the images as Docker images. The company uses Amazon Route 53 to configure DNS. The company saves the images in an Amazon S3 bucket and saves the metadata from the images in an Amazon DynamoDB table. The company wants to expand the workload to a second Region. A DevOps engineer needs to build a highly available and resilient design to expand the workload to the eu-west-2 Region. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements with the FEWEST configuration changes? (Choose three.)",
