    "type": "choice",
    "stem": "一家公司使用AWS Organizations、AWS Control Tower、AWS Config 和Terraform 来管理其AWS 账户和资源。该公司必须确保用户在成员AWS 账户中仅部署连接到VPC 的AWS Lambda 函数。哪种解决方案能以最少的运维工作量满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company uses AWS Organizations, AWS Control Tower, AWS Config, and Terraform to manage its AWS accounts and resources. The company must ensure that users deploy only AWS Lambda functions that are connected to a VPC in member AWS accounts. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational effort?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司使用AWS Organizations、AWS Control Tower、AWS Config 和Terraform 来管理其AWS 账户和资源。该公司必须确保用户在成员AWS 账户中仅部署连接到VPC 的AWS Lambda 函数。哪种解决方案能以最少的运维工作量满足这些要求？",
