        "textEn": "Create a new SCP. Include a conditional statement that uses a StringEquals condition operator to check the lambd:Vpclds condition key against a list of VPC IDs. Configure the SCP to allow the lambda CreateFunction action and the lambda UpdateFunctionConfiguration action if the value of the condition key matches one of the VPC IDs.",
        "textZh": "创建一个新的SCP。包含一个条件语句，该语句使用StringEquals 条件运算符将lambda:VpcIds 条件键与VPC ID 列表进行检查。如果条件键的值与某个VPC ID 匹配，则将该SCP 配置为允许lambda:CreateFunction 操作和lambda:UpdateFunctionConfiguration 操作。"
