        "textEn": "Create AWS Service Catalog products that contain common infrastructure components. Create a CDK app. Use the TagManager class to add cost allocation tags to the whole app. Use the Service Catalog products to write a higher-level construct that contains all the microservices. Deploy the microservices as a single CDK stack with environment-specific configurations.",
        "textZh": "创建包含常见基础设施组件的AWS Service Catalog 产品。创建一个CDK 应用。使用TagManager 类将成本分摊标签添加到整个应用。使用这些Service Catalog 产品编写一个更高层级的构造，其中包含所有微服务。将这些微服务作为一个单独的CDK 堆栈进行部署，并使用特定于环境的配置。"
