        "textEn": "Create AWS Service Catalog products that contain common infrastructure components. Create a CDK app. Use the Tags class to add cost allocation tags to the whole app. Use the Service Catalog products to write higher-level constructs for each microservice. Deploy the microservices as separate CDK stacks with environment-specific configurations.",
        "textZh": "创建包含常见基础设施组件的 AWS Service Catalog 产品。创建一个 CDK 应用。使用 Tags 类将成本分摊标签添加到整个应用。使用这些 Service Catalog 产品为每个微服务编写更高层级的构造。将这些微服务作为独立的 CDK 堆栈进行部署，并使用特定于环境的配置。"
