    "stem": "一家公司运行一个应用程序，该应用程序使用一个Amazon S3 存储桶来存储图像。某位DevOps 工程师需要为S3 对象实施多区域灾难恢复（DR）策略。DevOps 工程师在这些S3 存储桶之间启用了双向复制。公司必须能够故障转移到位于第二个AWS 区域中的第二个S3 存储桶。当图像被添加到任意一个S3 存储桶时，该图像必须在15 分钟内复制到另一个S3 存储桶。以下哪一组步骤组合能够以最高的运维效率满足这些要求？（选择三项。 ）",
    "stemEn": "A company runs an application that uses an Amazon S3 bucket to store images. A DevOps engineer needs to implement a multi-Region disaster recover (DR) strategy for the S3 objects. The DevOps engineer enables two-way replication between the S3 buckets. The company must be able to fail over to a second S3 bucket that is in a second AWS Region. When an image is added to either S3 bucket, the image must be replicated to the other S3 bucket within 15 minutes. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements in the MOST operationally efficient way? (Choose three.)",
