    "stem": "一家公司在AWS Organizations 中有一个组织。该组织已启用所有功能，并已为管理账户配置了AWS CloudTrail 可信访问。已为通知配置了一个Amazon Simple Notification Service（Amazon SNS）主题。公司需要将该组织中所有AWS 区域内的所有AWS 事件记录并保留在一个审计账户中。公司需要对任何失败的登录尝试进行近实时通知。一名DevOps 工程师已在管理账户中创建了一个组织级跟踪（organization trail） ，用于记录所有区域的事件。哪种解决方案以最少的运维工作量满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company has an organization in AWS Organizations. The organization has all features enabled and has AWS CloudTrail trusted access configured for the management account. An Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) topic is configured for notifications. The company needs all AWS events in all AWS Regions in the organization to be recorded and retained in an audit account. The company needs near real-time notifications of any failed login attempts. A DevOps engineer has created an organization trail in the management account to log events for all Regions. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational effort?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司在AWS Organizations 中有一个组织。该组织已启用所有功能，并已为管理账户配置了AWS CloudTrail 可信访问。已为通知配置了一个Amazon Simple Notification Service（Amazon SNS）主题。公司需要将该组织中所有AWS 区域内的所有AWS 事件记录并保留在一个审计账户中。公司需要对任何失败的登录尝试进行近实时通知。一名DevOps 工程师已在管理账户中创建了一个组织级跟踪（organization trail） ，用于记录所有区域的事件。哪种解决方案以最少的运维工作量满足这些要求？",
