        "text": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon S3 bucket in the management account. Configure an Amazon Athena table to read from the new S3 bucket. Create an AWS Lambda function that queries the Athena table for failed login events and publishes the findings to the SNS topic. Create an Amazon EventBridge scheduled rule to invoke the Lambda function every 5 minutes.",
        "textEn": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon S3 bucket in the management account. Configure an Amazon Athena table to read from the new S3 bucket. Create an AWS Lambda function that queries the Athena table for failed login events and publishes the findings to the SNS topic. Create an Amazon EventBridge scheduled rule to invoke the Lambda function every 5 minutes.",
        "textZh": "将该跟踪配置为把日志发布到管理账户中的一个新Amazon S3 存储桶。配置一个Amazon Athena 表从新的S3 存储桶读取数据。创建一个AWS Lambda 函数，查询Athena 表中的失败登录事件并将结果发布到SNS 主题。创建一个Amazon EventBridge 计划规则，每5 分钟调用一次该Lambda 函数。"
