        "text": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon S3 bucket in the audit account and a new Amazon CloudWatch log group in the management account. Create a CloudWatch Logs metric filter on the log group to create a custom metric for failed logins. Configure a CloudWatch alarm that uses the custom metric and notifies the SNS topic.",
        "textEn": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon S3 bucket in the audit account and a new Amazon CloudWatch log group in the management account. Create a CloudWatch Logs metric filter on the log group to create a custom metric for failed logins. Configure a CloudWatch alarm that uses the custom metric and notifies the SNS topic.",
        "textZh": "将该跟踪配置为把日志发布到审计账户中的一个新Amazon S3 存储桶，以及管理账户中的一个新的Amazon CloudWatch 日志组。对该日志组创建一个CloudWatch Logs 指标筛选器，以便为失败登录创建一个自定义指标。配置一个使用该自定义指标并通知SNS 主题的CloudWatch 告警。"
