        "text": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon CloudWatch log group in the audit account. Create an Amazon Kinesis data stream in the audit account. Configure a subscription filter on the log group to send the logs to the data stream. Use Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink to filter the data stream for failed logins. Publish the results to the SNS topic.",
        "textEn": "Configure the trail to publish logs to a new Amazon CloudWatch log group in the audit account. Create an Amazon Kinesis data stream in the audit account. Configure a subscription filter on the log group to send the logs to the data stream. Use Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink to filter the data stream for failed logins. Publish the results to the SNS topic.",
        "textZh": "将该跟踪配置为把日志发布到审计账户中的一个新的Amazon CloudWatch 日志组。在审计账户中创建一个Amazon Kinesis 数据流。对该日志组配置一个订阅筛选器，将日志发送到该数据流。使用Amazon Managed Service for Apache Flink 对数据流进行筛选以获取失败登录。将结果发布到SNS 主题。"
