        "textEn": "Configure a connection in AWS CodeConnections to a Git repository. Store the templates in the Git repository. Configure the pipeline to include a source action that uses the connection. Add a manual review action to the pipeline to review template modifications before the stack deployments.",
        "textZh": "在 AWS CodeConnections 中配置到 Git 仓库的连接。将模板存储在 Git 仓库中。配置流水线包含一个使用该连接的源（source）操作。向流水线添加一个手动审查操作，在堆栈部署之前审查模板修改。"
