    "stem": "一名DevOps 工程师需要配置一个AWS CodePipeline 管道，将容器镜像发布到Amazon Elastic Container Registry（Amazon ECR）存储库。该管道必须等待上一次运行完成，并且必须在向一个通过AWS CodeConnections 连接到的Git 存储库推送新的Git 标签时运行。一个现有的部署管道需要在发布新的容器镜像时运行作为响应。哪种解决方案将满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A DevOps engineer needs to configure an AWS CodePipeline pipeline that publishes container images to an Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) repository. The pipeline must wait for the previous run to finish and must run when new Git tags are pushed to a Git repository that is connected to AWS CodeConnections. An existing deployment pipeline needs to run in response to the publication of new container images. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一名DevOps 工程师需要配置一个AWS CodePipeline 管道，将容器镜像发布到Amazon Elastic Container Registry（Amazon ECR）存储库。该管道必须等待上一次运行完成，并且必须在向一个通过AWS CodeConnections 连接到的Git 存储库推送新的Git 标签时运行。一个现有的部署管道需要在发布新的容器镜像时运行作为响应。哪种解决方案将满足这些要求？",
