    "stem": "一家公司在一台使用Amazon Elastic Block Store（Amazon EBS）存储的Amazon EC2 实例上运行开发环境网站和数据库。该公司希望让该实例对底层硬件问题更具弹性。如果AWS 判定该实例已失去网络连接，该公司希望能够自动恢复该EC2 实例。哪种解决方案将满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company runs a development environment website and database on an Amazon EC2 instance that uses Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS) storage. The company wants to make the instance more resilient to underlying hardware issues. The company wants to automatically recover the EC2 instance if AWS determines the instance has lost network connectivity. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司在一台使用Amazon Elastic Block Store（Amazon EBS）存储的Amazon EC2 实例上运行开发环境网站和数据库。该公司希望让该实例对底层硬件问题更具弹性。如果AWS 判定该实例已失去网络连接，该公司希望能够自动恢复该EC2 实例。哪种解决方案将满足这些要求？",
