        "textEn": "Set up Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights for the ECS cluster. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to invoke an AWS Lambda function to analyze the task states. Program the Lambda function to use the ECS UpdateService API call to initiate a rollback if a specific percentage of tasks fail.",
        "textZh": "为ECS 集群设置Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights。创建一条Amazon EventBridge 规则以调用一个AWS Lambda 函数来分析任务状态。编写该Lambda 函数，在特定百分比的任务失败时使用ECS UpdateService API 调用来启动回滚。"
