        "text": "Set up Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights for the ECS cluster. Configure Application Insights to monitor key performance indicators of the microservices in the critical user journeys and API calls. Create CloudWatch alarms based on the insights. Use Amazon EventBridge to invoke an AWS Step Functions workflow to evaluate the alarms. Configure the workflow to initiate a rollback if necessary by using the alarms' built-in integration with Amazon ECS.",
        "textEn": "Set up Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights for the ECS cluster. Configure Application Insights to monitor key performance indicators of the microservices in the critical user journeys and API calls. Create CloudWatch alarms based on the insights. Use Amazon EventBridge to invoke an AWS Step Functions workflow to evaluate the alarms. Configure the workflow to initiate a rollback if necessary by using the alarms' built-in integration with Amazon ECS.",
        "textZh": "为ECS 集群设置Amazon CloudWatch Application Insights。将Application Insights 配置为监控关键用户旅程和API 调用中微服务的关键绩效指标。基于这些洞察创建CloudWatch 告警。使用Amazon EventBridge 调用一个AWS Step Functions 工作流来评估这些告警。将该工作流配置为在必要时通过告警与Amazon ECS 的内置集成来启动回滚。"
