        "id": "A",
        "text": "Register the ECS service as a scalable target in AWS Application Auto Scaling. Configure a target tracking scaling policy to scale the service in response to the queue size.",
        "textEn": "Register the ECS service as a scalable target in AWS Application Auto Scaling. Configure a target tracking scaling policy to scale the service in response to the queue size.",
        "textZh": "将 ECS 服务注册为 AWS Application Auto Scaling 中的可扩展目标。配置一个目标跟踪扩缩容策略，以根据队列大小对服务进行扩缩容。"
