        "text": "Increase the maximum number of messages that Amazon SQS requests to batch messages together. Use long polling to minimize the number of API calls to Amazon SQS during periods of low traffic.",
        "textEn": "Increase the maximum number of messages that Amazon SQS requests to batch messages together. Use long polling to minimize the number of API calls to Amazon SQS during periods of low traffic.",
        "textZh": "增加 Amazon SQS 在请求中返回的最大消息数量，以将消息批处理在一起。使用长轮询以在低流量期间将对 Amazon SQS 的 API 调用次数降到最低。"
