        "textEn": "Enable CloudFront with Origin Shield in the eu-west-1 Region. Configure Regional edge caches. Implement AWS Global Accelerator to route requests to the nearest Regional edge location. Enable S3 replication between the S3 bucket in us-east-1 and an S3 bucket in a different Region.",
        "textZh": "在 eu-west-1 区域启用带 Origin Shield 的 CloudFront。配置区域边缘缓存。实施 AWS Global Accelerator 将请求路由到最近的区域边缘站点。在 us-east-1 的 S3 存储桶与不同区域中的一个 S3 存储桶之间启用 S3 复制。"
