        "text": "Deploy the beta version to new EC2 instances in a new target group. Associate the new target group with the same ALB listener rule. Assign a weight of 90 to the existing target group. Assign a weight of 10 to the new target group.",
        "textEn": "Deploy the beta version to new EC2 instances in a new target group. Associate the new target group with the same ALB listener rule. Assign a weight of 90 to the existing target group. Assign a weight of 10 to the new target group.",
        "textZh": "将beta 版本部署到新EC2 实例上的一个新目标组中。将新目标组与相同ALB 的监听器规则关联。为现有目标组分配90 的权重。为新目标组分配10 的权重。"
