        "text": "Containerize and deploy the application on Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS). Use AWS CodeDeploy to deploy the beta version by using the CodeDeployDefault.ECSCanary10Percent15Minutes deployment configuration.",
        "textEn": "Containerize and deploy the application on Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS). Use AWS CodeDeploy to deploy the beta version by using the CodeDeployDefault.ECSCanary10Percent15Minutes deployment configuration.",
        "textZh": "将应用程序容器化并部署在 Amazon Elastic Container Service（Amazon ECS）上。使用 AWS CodeDeploy 通过CodeDeployDefault.ECSCanary10Percent15Minutes 部署配置来部署 beta 版本。"
