    "stem": "一家公司正在开发一个在Amazon EC2 Linux 实例上运行的Web 应用程序。该应用程序需要监控自定义性能指标。公司必须在多个实例之间收集API 响应时间和数据库查询延迟的指标。哪种解决方案能够以最少的运维开销生成自定义指标？",
    "stemEn": "A company is developing a web application that runs on Amazon EC2 Linux instances. The application requires monitoring of custom performance metrics. The company must collect metrics for API response times and database query latency across multiple instances. Which solution will generate the custom metrics with the LEAST operational overhead?",
