    "stem": "某公司在其AWS 账户的主要运营AWS 区域中使用AWS Lambda 函数。该公司手动创建了这些Lambda 函数。公司需要使用一个基于Python 的AWS Cloud Development Kit（AWS CDK）应用程序来管理这些Lambda 函数。哪种解决方案以最少的实施工作量满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company uses AWS Lambda functions in the primary operating AWS Region of its AWS account. The company manually created the Lambda functions. The company needs to use a Python-based AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) application to manage the Lambda functions. Which solution meets these requirements with the LEAST implementation effort?",
    "stemZh": "某公司在其AWS 账户的主要运营AWS 区域中使用AWS Lambda 函数。该公司手动创建了这些Lambda 函数。公司需要使用一个基于Python 的AWS Cloud Development Kit（AWS CDK）应用程序来管理这些Lambda 函数。哪种解决方案以最少的实施工作量满足这些要求？",
