        "textEn": "Start a partial scan by using the AWS CloudFormation infrastructure as code (IaC) generator. Filter by the Lambda resource type. Create a CloudFormation template from the scanned resources. Download the CloudFormation template. For each Lambda function, replace the Code/S3Bucket property and the Code/S3Key property with the Code/ZipFile property. Convert the CloudFormation template to an AWS CDK application.",
        "textZh": "使用AWS CloudFormation 基础设施即代码（IaC）生成器启动一次部分扫描。按Lambda 资源类型进行筛选。从扫描到的资源创建一个CloudFormation 模板。下载该CloudFormation 模板。针对每个Lambda 函数，将Code/S3Bucket 属性和Code/S3Key 属性替换为Code/ZipFile 属性。将该CloudFormation 模板转换为AWS CDK 应用程序。"
