        "textEn": "Create an AWS CodeBuild project. Set the public repository as the source. Configure the artifacts section of the project to use the S3 bucket as the destination. Ensure that artifact encryption is enabled in the artifacts configuration. Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule to initiate the CodeBuild project on a daily schedule.",
        "textZh": "创建一个AWS CodeBuild 项目。将公共仓库设置为源。在项目的artifacts（制品）部分配置使用该S3 存储桶作为目标。确保在制品配置中启用制品加密。配置一个Amazon EventBridge 规则以按每日计划启动CodeBuild 项目。"
