    "stem": "一家公司正在将一个应用程序迁移到Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS)。该公司希望将日志数据整合到us-west-2 区域的Amazon CloudWatch 中。目前，Amazon ECS 没有任何CloudWatch 日志组。当ECS 任务尝试启动时，公司收到以下错误代码：“服务my-service-name 无法放置任务，因为没有容器实例满足其所有要求。 ” ECS任务定义包括以下容器日志配置：\n```\n\"logConfiguration\": {\n    \"logDriver\": \"awslogs\",\n    \"options\": {\n        \"awslogs-create-group\": \"true\",\n        \"awslogs-group\": \"awslogs-mytask\",\n        \"awslogs-region\": \"us-west-2\",\n        \"awslogs-stream-prefix\": \"awslogs-mytask\",\n        \"mode\": \"non-blocking\",\n        \"max-buffer-size\": \"25m\"\n    }\n}\n```\nECS 集群使用Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling 组为任务提供容量。EC2 实例启动了一个Amazon ECS 优化的AMI。哪种解决方案可以解决此问题？",
    "stemEn": "A company is migrating an application to Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS). The company wants to consolidate log data in Amazon CloudWatch in the us-west-2 Region. No CloudWatch log groups currently exist for Amazon ECS. The company receives the following error code when an ECS task attempts to launch: \"service my-service-name was unable to place a task because no container instance met all of its requirements.\" The ECS task definition includes the following container log configuration:\n```\n\"logConfiguration\": {\n    \"logDriver\": \"awslogs\",\n    \"options\": {\n        \"awslogs-create-group\": \"true\",\n        \"awslogs-group\": \"awslogs-mytask\",\n        \"awslogs-region\": \"us-west-2\",\n        \"awslogs-stream-prefix\": \"awslogs-mytask\",\n        \"mode\": \"non-blocking\",\n        \"max-buffer-size\": \"25m\"\n    }\n}\n```\nThe ECS cluster uses an Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling group to provide capacity for tasks. EC2 instances launch an Amazon ECS-optimized AMI. Which solution will fix the problem?",
