    "stem": "一家公司有一个运行在AWS 上的Web 应用程序。Web 层使用Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 部署，采用Fargate 启动类型，并通过一个应用程序负载均衡器(ALB) 和Amazon Route 53 提供服务。该应用程序使用Amazon Keyspaces（适用于Apache Cassandra）的数据库。公司将容器镜像存储在Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 中，并定期推送新的镜像版本。公司需要实施一个多区域恢复策略，并在发生故障时自动切换到次要区域。哪种解决方案可以满足这些需求？",
    "stemEn": "A company has a web application that runs on AWS. The web tier uses an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) deployment with the Fargate launch type behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB) and Amazon Route 53. The application uses an Amazon Keyspaces (for Apache Cassandra) database. The company stores container images in Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR). New image versions are pushed regularly. The company needs to implement a multi-Region recovery strategy with automatic failover to a secondary Region. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
