        "textEn": "Enable AWS Control Tower. Build a pipeline in AWS CodePipeline to deploy the CloudFormation deployment from a centralized account. Create a CodeCommit repository to store the entire configuration package, including the CloudFormation templates and a manifest file that maps each CloudFormation template to its corresponding OU. After the code is updated in CodeCommit, initiate the pipeline and deploy the CloudFormation templates to the new AWS accounts.",
        "textZh": "启用AWS Control Tower。在AWS CodePipeline 中构建一个管道，从集中账户部署CloudFormation 模板。创建一个CodeCommit 仓库来存储整个配置包，包括CloudFormation 模板和一个清单文件，该文件将每个CloudFormation 模板映射到其对应的OU。在CodeCommit 中更新代码后，启动管道并将CloudFormation 模板部署到新的AWS 账户。"
