        "textEn": "Store the CloudFormation templates in an Amazon S3 bucket by using a separate prefix for each AWS account. Create an AWS Lambda function that deploys a specific CloudFormation template to each new AWS account based on the prefix path that indicates where each template is located in the S3 bucket.",
