    "stem": "一家公司使用AWS CodePipeline 来自动化基于容器的应用程序的发布流程。该公司将应用程序托管在Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 集群上。每当公司更新代码时，流水线会自动构建并部署新版本。该公司使用AWS CodeDeploy 执行部分部署。一些部署会对许多用户造成问题。一名DevOps 工程师需要更新应用程序交付解决方案，以包含一个步骤，用于通过一部分客户验证更改。更新后的解决方案必须具备回滚失败部署的能力。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company uses AWS CodePipeline to automate the release process for a container-based application. The company hosts the application on an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) cluster. Whenever the company updates the code, the pipeline automatically builds and deploys the new version. The company uses AWS CodeDeploy to perform some of the deployments. Some deployments cause issues for many users. A DevOps engineer needs to update the application delivery solution to include a step to validate the changes with a subset of customers. The updated solution must provide the ability to revert failed deployments. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
