    "stem": "一名DevOps 工程师正在更新Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 集群中的现有服务。该服务使用滚动更新部署类型。所有对集群的更新均通过AWS CloudFormation 部署。当前，当部署失败时没有自动修复措施。服务会保持在FAILED 状态，直到DevOps 团队手动解决发现的问题。 DevOps 工程师需要配置一个自动化解决方案，以在由于服务任务启动失败而导致部署失败时进行修复。服务必须自动回滚到最近一次已完成的部署。哪种解决方案能够以最少的运营开销满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A DevOps engineer is updating an existing service in an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) cluster. The service uses the rolling update deployment type. All updates to the cluster are deployed by using AWS CloudFormation. Currently no automated remediation occurs when a deployment fails. The service remains in a FAILED state until the DevOps team manually resolves the discovered issues. The DevOps engineer needs to configure an automatic solution to remediate when a deployment fails because the service task fails to start. The service must be automatically rolled back to its most recent completed deployment. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead?",
    "stemZh": "一名DevOps 工程师正在更新Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 集群中的现有服务。该服务使用滚动更新部署类型。所有对集群的更新均通过AWS CloudFormation 部署。当前，当部署失败时没有自动修复措施。服务会保持在FAILED 状态，直到DevOps 团队手动解决发现的问题。 DevOps 工程师需要配置一个自动化解决方案，以在由于服务任务启动失败而导致部署失败时进行修复。服务必须自动回滚到最近一次已完成的部署。哪种解决方案能够以最少的运营开销满足这些要求？",
