    "stem": "一家公司运行一个应用程序，该应用程序作为Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 任务来处理来自Amazon Simple Queue Service (Amazon SQS) 队列的消息。ECS 任务按照计划每10 分钟处理一次SQS 队列。大量消息被发送到SQS 队列。应用程序花费了数小时处理所有消息。公司的新服务级别目标(SLO) 要求应用程序必须在消息传递后的10 分钟内处理消息。一名DevOps 工程师需要配置应用程序以满足SLO，同时尽量减少空闲运行的资源。哪种解决方案以最高的操作效率满足这些要求？",
    "stemEn": "A company runs an application as an Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) task to process messages from an Amazon Simple Queue Service (Amazon SQS) queue. The ECS task runs on a schedule to process the SQS queue every 10 minutes. A high volume of messages was delivered to the SQS queue. The application took several hours to process all the messages. The company's new service level objective (SLO) requires that the application must process messages within 10 minutes of delivery. A DevOps engineer needs to configure the application to meet the SLO while minimizing idle running resources. Which solution meets these requirements with the MOST operational efficiency?",
    "stemZh": "一家公司运行一个应用程序，该应用程序作为Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 任务来处理来自Amazon Simple Queue Service (Amazon SQS) 队列的消息。ECS 任务按照计划每10 分钟处理一次SQS 队列。大量消息被发送到SQS 队列。应用程序花费了数小时处理所有消息。公司的新服务级别目标(SLO) 要求应用程序必须在消息传递后的10 分钟内处理消息。一名DevOps 工程师需要配置应用程序以满足SLO，同时尽量减少空闲运行的资源。哪种解决方案以最高的操作效率满足这些要求？",
